<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">1 Lalte</book>
  <para style="h">1 Lalte</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Lalte</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Lalte</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Lalte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida chu a lo upain a lo tar ta hle a, puan an sintîr pawhin a mu lum zo ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhte chuan a hnênah, “Ka pu, i kianga awma enkawl tûr che nula kan zawng ang e. Ani chu i bulah a mu ang a, kan pu hi i mu lum thei dâwn nia,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel ram pumah nula hmêlṭha an zawng ta a. Sunam mi, Abisagi an va hmu a, lal hnênah an rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu nula chu hmêlṭha tak a ni. Lal chu a enkawl a, a kiangah a awm reng a; mahse, lal chuan a pâwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hagiti laka Davida fapa Adonija chu lal fa la damte zînga upa ber a nih avângin lal tûrah a lo inngai a. Tawlailîr te, sakawr chungchuang mite leh amah vêngtu mi sawmnga a ruat diam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A pa lah chuan, “Engati nge hetianga i khawsak le?” tiin a kamkhat ngai si lo va. Tlangvâl hmêlṭha tak Absaloma dawt chiah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adonija chuan Zeruii fapa Joaba leh puithiam Abiathara te chu a râwn a, anni chu a lamah an ṭang a, an pui ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Simeia te, Reia te leh mi huaisen, Davida vêngtu te erawh chuan Adonija chu an zui ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Adonija chuan En-rogel kianga Zebelet lungpui zâwlah chuan inthawi nân berâm te, bâwngpa te, ran châwm thau te a talh a. A unau lal fapa zawng zawng leh Judai rama lal khâwnbâwl zawng zawng a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâwlnei Nathana te, Benaia te, mi huaisen lal vêngtu te leh a unau Solomona erawh chu a sâwm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nathana chuan Solomona nu Bathsebi hnênah, “Hagiti fapa Adonija hi kan pu Davida hriat lohvin a lal ta tih i hre na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tûnah, i himna tûr leh i fapa Solomona himna tûr ka hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal Davida hnênah va lût la, a hnênah, ‘Aw lalber, ka pu, i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian, ‘Solomona hi ka aiawha lal tûr a ni, ka lalṭhutthlêng a luah ang’ tiin i tiam a ni lâwm ni? Engtizia nge Adonija hi a lal tâk mai le?’ va ti la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal chu i biak laiin ka lo lût ve ang a, i thu sawi chu ka rawn nemnghet dâwn nia,” tiin thu a râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bathsebi chu lal pindanah a va kal a, lal chu a tar hle tawh a, Sunam mi Abisagi chuan a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bathsebi chuan lal chu kûnin chibai a bûk a, Lal chuan, “Eng nge i duh le?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka pu, i bawihnu hnênah hian Lalpa , i Pathian hming chhâlin, ‘I fapa Solomona hi ka aiawhin a la lal ang a, ka lalṭhutthlêng a luah ang’ tiin i tiam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mahse, hei, Adonija a lal ta reng mai. Ka pu lah hian i hre ve si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bâwngpa te, ran châwm thau te a talh ṭeuh va, lal fapa te, puithiam Abiathara te, sipai hotu Joaba te a sâwm a, i chhiahhlawh Solomona erawh chu a sâwm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka pu, Israel mi zawng zawng hian lalṭhutthlêngah tu nge i ṭhuttîr dâwn tih an thlîr reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hei hi i tihfel loh chuan, ka pu hi, i thih hunah kei leh ka fapa Solomona chu phiarrutuah min puh dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutia lal a biak lai tak chuan zâwlnei Nathana chu a lo lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Zâwlnei Nathana pawh a lo kal e,” tiin lal chu an hrilh a. Lal hnênah chuan a va kal a, a kûn a, bawkkhupin chibai a bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nathana chuan, “Ka pu lalber hian ‘Adonija chu ka aiawhin a lal ang a, ka lalṭhutthlêng a luah ang,’ a ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vawiin hian a thawk chhuak a, bâwngpa tam tak te, ran châwm thau te, berâm te a talh a, lal fapa zawng zawng leh sipai hotu te, puithiam Abiathara te a sâwm a. Tûnah hian an eiin an in ho va, ‘Lal Adonija dam reng rawh se,’ tiin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei i chhiahhlawh hi puithiam Zadoka te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te leh i chhiahhlawh Solomona te nên min sâwm ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hei hi ka pu lalber thu-a tih a nih si chuan, ka pu hian a thih hnua a lalṭhutthlêng luahtu tûr a chhiahhlawhte a hrilh ve lo a ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan, “Bathsebi han ko teh u,” a ti a. Ani chu lal hnênah chuan a va kal a, a hmaah a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal chuan heti hian a sawi a, “Manganna tinrêng laka min humhimtu Lalpa hming chhâlin ka tiam a che, Israel te Pathian Lalpa hming chhâla i hnêna ka tiam tawh chu tûnah ka hlen ngei ngei dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I fapa Solomona chu ka aiawhin a lal ang a, ka lalṭhutthlêng hi a luah ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bathsebi chuan bawkkhupin lal chu chibai a bûk a, “Ka pu, lal Davida chu dam reng rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lal Davida chuan, “Puithiam Zadoka te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te han ko teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan an lo kal a, Lal chuan an hnênah, “Mi lianho hruai ula, ka fapa Solomona chu ka sabengtung chungah chuantîr ula, Gihon-ah hruai thla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Chutah chuan Puithiam Zadoka leh zâwlnei Nathana chuan Israel lal atân hriak thih rawh se. Tawtawrâwt hâm ula, ‘Lal Solomona chu dam reng rawh se,’ tiin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ani chu in rawn zui ang a, ka lalṭhutthlêngah ṭhu sela, ka aiah a lal ang. Ani hi Israel leh Judai ram chunga rorêltu atân ka ruat a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chuan, “Amen, ka pu, i Pathian, Lalpa chuan nemnghet rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lalpa chu, ka pu lalber hnêna a awm ṭhîn angin Solomona hnênah pawh awm sela; ka pu lal Davida lalṭhutthlêng aiin a lalṭhutthlêng chu tinghet zâwk rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia, Keret mite leh Pelet mite chu an kal a, Solomona chu Davida sabengtung chungah an chuantîr a, Gihon-ah chuan an hruai thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka chuan Hmun Thianghlima hriak dahna ki chu a la a, Solomona chu a thih a. Tawtawrâwt an hâm a, mi zawng zawng chuan, “Lal Solomona dam reng rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi zawng zawngin ani chu an zui chho va, phênglâwngte an tum a, an hlim êm êm a, an thâwm chuan lei a nghawr dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Adonija leh a mi sâwm, a hnêna awm zawng zawngin ruai an ṭheh zawh chuan thâwm chu an hria a. Tawtawrâwt ri an hriatin Joaba chuan, “Khawpui chhûnga thâwm ri dur dur chu engtizia nge ni ta le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chu thu a sawi lai mêk chuan puithiam Abiathara fapa Jonathana a lo thleng a. Adonija chuan, “Lo kal teh khai, nang zawng tlangvâl fel tak i ni a, chanchin lâwmawm i rawn thlen châwk ang chu maw?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jonathana chuan, “Thlen awzâwng lo, kan pu lal Davida chuan Solomona chu lalah a siam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lal chuan puithiam Zadoka te, zâwlnei Nathana te, Jehoiada fapa Benaia te, Keret mi te, Pelet mi te chu vêng tûrin a tîr a. Ani chu lal sabengtung chungah an chuantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Puithiam Zadoka leh zâwlnei Nathana chuan Gihon-ah lal atân hriak an thih ta. Chuta ṭang chuan hlim takin an lo chho va, an thâwm chu khawpui a khat a, chu chu in hriat hi a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Solomona chuan lalṭhutthlêng a luah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Milianho pawh an lo kal a, kan pu lal Davida hnênah, “I Pathian chuan Solomona chu nang aiin tiropui sela, a lalṭhutthlêng pawh i lalṭhutthlêng aiin tiropui rawh se,” tiin an rawn lawmpui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lal pawhin a khumlaizâwl aṭangin chibai a bûk a, ‘ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, vawiina ka lalṭhutthlênga ka aiawhtu tûr ka mit ngeia min hmuhtîrtu chu fakin awm rawh se,’ tiin a sawi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chu veleh Adonija mi sâwmho chuan an hlau va, an tlân darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Adonija chuan Solomona chu a hlau ta hle a, a tho va, maichâm ki a vuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Solomona hnênah chuan, “Adonija chuan lal Solomona a hlauh êm avângin maichâm ki a vuan reng mai. ‘Lal Solomonan a chhiahhlawh hi khandaiha that lo tûrin chhia chham teh se,’ a ti,” tiin Solomona chu an va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Rinawm taka a awm phawt chuan a samzai pakhat pawh ka khawih lo vang. A sualna hmuh a nih erawh chuan a thi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan mi a tîr a, maichâm ata an va hruai chhuak a, Adonija chu a lo kal a, Lal Solomona chu kûnin chibai a bûk a, ani chuan, “In lamah va haw tawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Davida thih hun chu a lo hnai a, a fapa Solomona chu hetiang hian thu a chah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mi dangte ang bawkin ka lo thi ve dâwn ta a, patling takin awm la, zâm rêng rêng suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , i Pathianin a phûtte chu zâwm la, a kawng zawh la, a thuruat te, a thupêk te, awm dân tûr a tih te leh a thu hriattîr, Mosia Dân bu-a ziak te chu zâwm la; tichuan, i thiltih apiangah te, i kalna apiangah te i lo hmuingîl thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘I thlahte chu fîmkhur taka an khawsaka, thinlung leh tih tak zeta ka thupêkte an zawm chuan Israel-te lalṭhutthlêng hi an luah reng ang,’ tia a tiam kha a hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeruii fapa Joaba hian ka pawi a khawih kha hre reng rawh; Israel sipai hotu pahnih, Nera fapa Abnera leh Jethera fapa Amasa a thah kha. Râlmuan laiin indo lai ang ziazângin thisen phuba a la a, pawi khawih lo thisen a chhuah hi a mawh ka phur a, ka tân a pawi hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tih dân tûr chu i hre mai ang, tarkûnin dam suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead mi Barzilaia fate chu lo khawngaih la, i dawhkânah chaw kîltîr ve ang che. I unaupa Absaloma hlauva ka tlânchhiat lai khân min lo khawngaih si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tin, hei, Bahurim khuaa mi Benjamina thlah, Gera fapa Simeia hi i hnênah a awm a; ani hi Mahanaim pana ka kal lai khân ânchhia min lawh a; mahse, Jordan-ah mi hmuak tûrin a lo chhuk a, chutah chuan, “Khandaihin ka that lo vang che,” tiin Lalpa hming chhâlin a hnênah thu ka tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, hrem loh chuan chhuah suh ang che, patling i ni a, tih dân tûr chu i hre mai ang. A tar hunah i that dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Davida chu a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel-te chungah kum sawmli a lal a, kum sarih Hebron-ah, kum sawmthum leh pathum chu Jerusalem-ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomona chu a pa aiawhin a lal ta a, ram chu a nghet ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hagiti fapa Adonija chu Solomona nu Bathsebi hnênah a kal a, ani chuan, “Ṭha lam thu-a lo kal em i nih?” a ti a. Adonija chuan, “Aw, ṭha lam thu ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “I hnênah eng emaw sawi tûr ka nei e,” a ti a. Bathsebi chuan, “Sawi ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ram hi ka ta a ni tawh zet a, Israel-ho zawng zawng pawhin an lal angah min en tih i hria a; mahse, thil a inher danglam a, ram chu ka unaupa chan a lo ni leh ta zâwk a, chu chu Lalpa remruat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah, thil pakhat dîl che ka duh, mi remtihsak hrâm rawh;” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni a?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Adonija chuan, “Khawngaih takin lal Solomona mi biaksak rawh, i thu zawng a hnial âwm si lo va, Sunam mi Abisagi hi nupuiah mi neihtîr teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bathsebi chuan, “Ni e, lal chu ka lo biaksak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bathsebi chu Adonija biaksak tûrin lal Solomona hnênah a kal a; lal chu amah lo lâwm tûrin a tho va, kûnin chibai a bûk a, lalṭhutthlêngah chuan a ṭhu leh ta a. Lal nu tân ṭhutthlêng dang an rawn la a, a ding lamah chuan an ṭhuttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lal nu chuan, “Thil tê tham tê ka dîl duh che a, min remtihsak hrâm ang che,” a ti a. Lal chuan, “Eng nge ni le? Ka nu, ka remtihsak ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Sunam mi Abisagi hi i unaupa Adonija nupui atân pe rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan a nu hnênah, “Engtiziaa Sunam mi Abisagi hi Adonija tâna dîl nge i nih? Lalṭhutthlêng pawh hi dilsak ta law law che. Ka u a ni a, a tân te, a lamṭang puithiam Abiathara leh Zeruii fapa Joaba tân te pawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Lalpa hming chhâlin hetiangin chhia a chham a, “Adonija chuan a thihna tûr a dîl a nih loh nâ chuan Pathianin a tih tihin min ti sela, na tak pawhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tûnah, Lalpa , a thutiam anga ka pa lalṭhutthlênga min ṭhuttîra min tinghettu, kan chhûngkua lalna min dinsaktu nunna chhâlin ka sawi e, vawiinah Adonija hi tihhlum tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu a tîr a, Adonija chu a bei a, a va that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal chuan, Abiathara hnênah, “I khua Anathot-ah haw rawh, thi mai tlâk zawng i ni a; mahse, tûnah zawng ka that rih lo vang che. Ka pa Davida hmaa Engkim Lalpa Bâwm i lo zâwn ṭhin avâng leh harsatna a tuarte i tuarpui ve avângin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Solomona chuan Abiathara chu Lalpa puithiam a nihna a bân a, Elia chhûngte chungchâng Silo khuaa Lalpa sawi chu a lo thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu thu chu Joaban a lo hria a, Absaloma lamah a ṭang lo na a, Adonija lamṭang a ni si a. Tichuan, Lalpa inah a tlân lût a, maichâm ki a vuan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Joaba chu Lalpa puan inah a tlân lût a, maichâm bulah a tawm,” tiin lal Solomona an hrilh a. Solomona chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia hnênah, “Kal la, va that rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Benaia chu Lalpa puan inah a lût a, Joaba hnênah chuan, “Lalin lo chhuak rawh a ti,” a va ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni lo ve, hetah hian ka thi mai ang e,” a ti a. Benaia chuan, “Joaba chuan hetiangin min lo chhâng e,” tiin lal chu a va hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lal chuan, “A sawi ang chuan va that la, phûm nghâl rawh. Kei leh ka pa chhûngte hi Joaban pawi khawih lo thisen a chhuah lak ata kan fihlîm thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka pa Davida hriat lohvin mi pahnih a bei a, khandaihin a that a, Lalpa chuan a thisen chhuah man thungrûl rawh se. Chûng mi pahnih, Nera fapa Abnera, Israel sipai hotu leh Jethera fapa Amasa, Juda sipai hotute kha, amah aia ṭha leh tling an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An thisen chhuah man chu Joaba leh a thlahte lu chungah tla kumkhua rawh se. Davida te, a thlah te, a chhûngkua leh a lalṭhutthlêng te erawh chu Lalpa chuan tihmuingîl zêl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu a han chho va, Joaba chu a bei a, a that ta a; thlalêra ama inah chuan an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lal chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu sipai hotu ber atân Joaba hmunah a dah a, puithiam Zadoka chu Abiathara ai a awhtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lal chuan Simeia a kohtîr a, a hnênah, “Jerusalem-ah in sa la; tah chuan awm la, khawiah mah kal chhuak suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />I chhuaha Kidron ruam i kân ni chu i thih ni a ni mai tih hre rawh; i thisen mawh chu nangman i phur ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Simeian lal hnênah, “Ni e, Lalpa , ka puin i sawi ang chuan i chhiahhlawhin a ti zêl ang,” a ti a. Simeia chu Jerusalem-ah a awm ta rêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kum thum hnuah chuan Simeia chhiahhlawhte zînga mi pahnih chu Gath khaw lal Maaka fapa Akisa hnênah an tlân a. Miin Simeia hnênah, “I chhiahhlawhte Gath khuaah an awm e,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chu veleh Simeia chuan a sabengtung a thuam a, a chhiahhlawhte chu zawng tûrin Gath khuaa Akisa hnênah a kal ta a. Simeia chuan chhiahhlawhte chu Gath ata a rawn hruai hâwng leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Simeia chu Jerusalem aṭangin Gath khuaah a kal a, a lo kîr leh tih Solomona chu an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lal chuan Simeia chu a ko va, a hnênah, “Hmun danga i chhuah chuan i kal ni la lain i thi ang tiin Lalpa hming chhâlin chhia ka chhamtîr che a, ka hrilh lâwk che a ni lâwm ni? Chutih lai chuan nang pawhin ka hnênah, ‘Ni e, ka zâwm ang e,’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Engati nge Lalpa hnêna i thutiam chu i zawm lohva, thu ka pêk che chu i bawhchhiat?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Lal chuan Simeia hnênah, “Ka pa Davida chunga i sualzia kha i la hre vek a, tûnah Lalpa chuan i suahsual man a thungrûl ve ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kei erawh chu mal min sâwm ang a, Davida lalṭhutthlêng chu Lalpa hmaah nghet takin a ding reng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lal chuan Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu thu a pe a, ani chuan a va bei a, a that ta a. Solomona chu nghet takin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chuan Aigupta lal Farawa nên inkûngkaih nân a fanu chu nupuiah a nei a; lal in te, Tempul te, Jerusalem khaw kulh bangte a siam zawh hma chuan a nupui chu Davida khawpuiah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite chu hmunsângahte an inthawi ṭhîn a, Lalpa Tempul sak a la nih rih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa chu a hmangaih a, a pa Davida zirtîrnate chu a zâwm a; mahse, hmunsângahte thilhlante a hlân a, rimtui te a hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chu thilhlan hlân tûrin Gibeon-ah a kal a, chu chu thilhlanna hmunpui ber a ni. Solomonan chuta maichâmah chuan hâlral thilhlan atân ran sângkhat zet a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gibeon-ah chuan Solomona mangah Lalpa chu a inlâr a, Pathian chuan, “I duh apiang min dîl rawh, ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomona chuan, “I chhiahhlawh Davida, ka pa chu i lakah a rinawm a, dik tak leh thinlung thianghlim taka a awm avângin i ngaina êm êm ṭhîn a, a chunga i ngilneihna nasa tak avângin tûnah a lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr fapa i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûnah hian, aw Lalpa ka Pathian, i chhiahhlawh hi ka pa Davida aiawhin min laltîr a, kei lah naupang mai ka ni a, ka tih tûr hlen chhuah dân pawh ka hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hi i mi, i thlan, eng zât nge an nih pawh hriat lohte chungah lalah mi siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu dik leh dik lote thliara fel taka i mite ro ka rêlsak theih nân i chhiahhlawh hi finna pe ang che. Chuti lo zawng, mi heti zozai hi ro ka rêlsak thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomona thil dîl avâng chuan Lalpa chu a chungah a lâwm ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian chuan a hnênah, “Dam reina te, hausakna te, i hmêlmate thihna tûr dîl lovin dik taka rorêl thiamna i dîl zâwk avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />i dîl chu ka pe ang che, i hmaa mi tu ma neih ngai loh i hnua mite pawhin an neih loh tûr finna leh rorêl thiamna ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I dîl loh hausakna leh hmingthanna ka pe bawk ang che. I dam chhûngin lal tu mahin an tluk lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I pa Davida anga ka kawngte i zawha, ka thuruat leh ka thupêkte i zawm chuan rei tak ka damtîr ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomona chu a lo harh a, a mumangah Pathianin thu a sawi a ni tih a hria a. Jerusalem-ah a lo hâwng a, Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah a ding a, hâlral thilhlante leh remna thilhlante a hlân a, a chhiahhlawh zawng zawng tân ruai a ṭheh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ni khat chu nawhchizuar pahnih lal hnênah an lo kal a, a hmaah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pakhat chuan, “Ka pu, he hmeichhia nên hian in khatah kan chêng dûn a; chuta kan awm lai chuan nau ka nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nau neih aṭanga ni thum niah he hmeichhia hian nau a hring ve a. Chu inah chuan tu mah dang an awm lo va, kan pahnih chauhvin kan awm dûn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zânah he hmeichhia hian a fapa chu a delh hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zan laiah a tho va, i bawihnu hi ka muthilh laiin ka fapa, ka kianga mu chu, a la a, a pawm ta a, a fapa thi chu mi pawmtîr ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zînga hnute pe tûra ka han thawh chuan nautê thi chu ka hmu a, ka han en chian chuan ka fapa, ka hrina kha a ni ta hauh lo mai a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pakhat zâwk chuan, “Ni lo, a dam zâwk hi ka fapa a ni a, a thi hi i fapa a ni,” a ti a. A hmasa zâwk chuan, “Ni lo, a thi hi i fapa a ni a, a dam zâwk hi ka fapa a ni,” a ti tlat a. Chutiang chuan lal hmaah an inhnial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal chuan, “He nu hian, ‘A dam zâwk kha ka fapa a ni a, a thi kha i fapa a ni,’ a ti a. Ani lah hian, ‘Chutiang a ni lo, a thi zâwk hi i fapa a ni a, a dam hi ka fa zâwk a ni,’ a ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khandaih mi han pe teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khandaih chu an han pe a, lal chuan, “Naute la dam chu bung hnihah chhuah ula, a chanve pakhat pe ula, a chanve dang chu hmeichhe pakhat kha pe rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Naupang dam zâwka nu chuan a fapa chu a lainat êm avângin lal hnênah chuan, “Ka pu, khawngaih takin nautê chu he mi hi pe mai rawh; that lul suh ang che,” a ti a. Pakhat zâwk chuan, “Bung hnihah chhuah mai rawh, tu mah mahin kan chang lo mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chuan hetiangin thu a rem ta a; “Nausên dam chu he nu, thu rawn sawi hmasatu hi pe rawh u, that suh u, hei hi a nu tak a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawngin lal thurem chu an hriatin lal chu an zah ta hle a, Pathianin dik taka rorêl thiamna a pe tih an hria a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Solomona chu Israel mi zawng zawng lal a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hêng hi a miliante chu an ni: An puithiam chu Zadoka fapa Azaria a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziaktu lian chu Elihorefa leh Sisa fapa Ahija an ni. Ahiluda fapa Jehosafata chu chanchin ziaktu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaia chu sipai hotu a ni. Zadoka leh Abiathara te chu puithiam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nathana fapa Azaria chu ram bial ṭhen enkawltute chunga hotu ber a ni. Nathana fapa Zabuda chu lal puithiam leh lal kaiza vêngtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahisara chu lal in enkawltu a ni a; Abda fapa Adonirama chu hnathawka rawih luihte hotu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solomona chuan Israel ram pum pui chu bial sâwm leh pahnihah a ṭhen a, an chungah hotu a ruat vek a. Chûngte chuan lal tân leh lal chhûngkaw tân ei tûr an pe ṭhîn. Hotu pakhatin thla khat chhûng tumin kum tluanin ei tûr an tumsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hêng hi hotute hming leh an thawhna bial hming chu a ni: Efraim tlângramah Ben-Hura.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Makaz te, Salbim te, Beth-semes te, Elon te leh Beth-hanan khaw hotu chu Ben-dekera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arubot leh Soko te leh Hefer ram zawng zawng nêna enkawltu chu Ben-heseda a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dor bial pum enkawltu chu Ben-Abinadaba a ni. Ani chuan Solomona fanu Tafati nupuiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tanak leh Megido te, Zerethan dep Jezreel hnuai, Beth-sean aṭanga Abel Mehola leh Jokmeam thlengin, Beth-sean ram pum nêna enkawltu chu Ahiluda fapa Baana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gilead rama Ramot khua te, Manasea thlah, Jaira chhûngte chênna khua Gilead rama mi te, Basan ram, Argob biala kulh leh dâr tlâwn kawngkhâr kalhna nei khaw sawmruk te enkawltu chu Ben-gebera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mahanaim bial enkawltu chu Idoa fapa Ahinadaba a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naftali bial enkawltu chu Ahimaaza a ni. Ani chuan Solomona fanu Basemathi nupuiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aser leh Bealoth bial enkawltu chu Husaia fapa Baana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isakar bial enkawltu chu Parua fapa Jehosafata a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Benjamin bial enkawltu chu Ela fapa Simeia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gilead ram, Amor lal Sihona ram Gilead te, Oga ram Basan te huama enkawltu chu Uria, Gebera fapa a ni. Hêng mi sâwm leh pahnih bâkah a ram pum pui chunga hotu pakhat a la awm bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Juda-te leh Israel-te chu tuifinriat kama ṭiau zât zetin an tam a. An eiin an in a, an hlim hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomona chuan Eufretis lui aṭanga Aigupta ram dep Filistia ram thlengin ro a rêl a. Chûng lai ram zawng zawng chuan Solomona hnênah chhiah an pe a, Solomona dam chhûng chu a khua leh tui an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomona ni khat ei ral chu chhangphut ṭha chi kg. sângnga, chhangphut narân kg. sîngkhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ran châwm thau sâwm, rama tla ṭhîn bâwngpa sawmhnih, berâm za leh sakhi te, sazuk te, saza te, âr châwm thau te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Solomona chuan Eufretis luipui khawthlang Tifsa khua aṭanga Gaza thlengin ro a rêl a. A chhehvêla ram dangte nên an inrem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomona dam chhûng chuan Juda-te leh Israel-te chu Dan aṭanga Beer-seba thlengin mi tin mahni grep huanah leh theipui hmunah thlamuang takin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomona chuan tawlailîr hnûktu sakawr sîngli leh sakawr chungchuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ramawptute chuan mahni chan thla ṭheuhvah lal Solomona leh a dawhkâna chaw kîltute tân ei tûr an ngaihtuah a, eng mah an tlachham ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan a indawtin sakawr te, tawlailîr hnûk sakawrte tân an tla tâwk buhpâwl leh barli an rawn pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin Solomona chu finna leh hriatna thûk tak a pe a, rilru zau tak, chhui chhuah rual loh khawp a pe bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Solomona chu khawchhak mi fingte leh Aigupta mi fingte aiin a fing a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khawvêla mi fing ber a ni. Ezra mi Ethana te, Mahola fa Hamana te, Kalkola te leh Darda te aiin a fing zâwk a, a chhehvêl ram tinah a hming a thang hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thufing sângthum a siam a, hla sângkhat leh panga a phuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thlai chanchin, Lebanon tlânga sidar thing aṭanga kulh banga ṭo husop chenin a zir vek a. Ramsa te, sava te, bawkvâka kal leh sangha chanchin te pawh a hre hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khawvêla lal zawng zawng chuan Solomona finzia zir tûrin an mite a hnênah an tîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tura lal Hirama chuan Solomona chu a pa Davida aiawh tûra hriakthih a ni tih a lo hriatin a hnênah palai a tîr a. A pa Davida nên an lo inṭhian si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomona chuan Hirama hnênah hetiangin thu a thawn lêt a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pa Davida kha, a chhehvêl ramte nên an indo ṭhîn a, Lalpa chuan a hmêlmate a hnehtîr vek hma chuan, Lalpa , a Pathian a biakna tûr Tempul a sa thei lo tih i hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tûnah, Lalpa , ka Pathianin kan chhehvêl ramte nên min inremtîr a, hmêlma leh min tibuaitu tûr an awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka pa Davida hnênah, ‘I fapa, lalṭhutthlêng luahtu tûr chuan ka hming chawimawi nân Tempul a la sa ang,’ tia a lo tiam tawh angin Lalpa , ka Pathian hming ropui nân Tempul sak ka tum ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah, Lebanon tlânga sidar thing mi rawn pe tûrin thu pe rawh; ka mite leh i miten thawk ho sela, i mite chu i tih zât zât hlawh ka lo pe ang e. Sidon mite anga thing kih thiam tu mah ka nei lo tih i hre si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hiraman Solomona thu a lo hriat chuan a lâwm hle a, a hnênah, “He hnam ropui tak chunga rorêl tûra fapa fing tak Davida hnêna petu Lalpa chu vawiin hian fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hirama chuan Solomona hnênah, “I thu mi chah chu ka lo hria a, sidar thing leh fâr thing chu i duh zât zât ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite chuan thing chu Lebanon tlâng aṭangin tuifinriatah an rawn hnûk thla ang a, an têl khâwm ang a, dahna tûr i tih hmunah an rawn tawlh thleng ang a, chutah chuan an phelh darh hnuah i mite chuan an lo la dâwn nia. Nang pawhin ka mite hi ei tûr i lo tumsak ve a ni ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hirama chuan sidar leh fâr thing a mamawh zât chu a lo pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Solomona pawhin Hirama chu chhangphut ṭin nuai li leh oliv hriak ṭha chi ṭin zali a mite ei atân a pe a. Chutiang chuan kum tin Solomona chuan Hirama chu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lo tiam tawh angin Lalpa chuan Solomona chu finna a pe a, Hirama leh Solomona inlaichînna chu a ṭha hle a, inremna thu an thlung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Solomona chuan Israel ram pumah hna thawka rawih luih pâwl a siam a, chûng chu mi sîngthum lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adonirama chu chûngho enkawltu chu a ni. Anni chu pâwl thumah a ṭhen a, a inchhâwkin sîngkhat zêl Lebanon-ah thla khat chhûng an han thang a, thla hnih in lamah an awm leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Solomona chuan thuamphur mi sîngsarih leh lung chher mi sîngriat tlângramah chuan a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng bâkah hnathawkho vêngtu mi sângthum leh zathum a nei bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal thupêk ang chuan lung ṭha chi lian tak tak Tempul lungphûma rem tûr an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In satuho Solomona mi te, Hirama mi te leh Biblos khuaa mi te chuan lung te, thing te chu Tempul hmanrua atân an buatsaih ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel faten Aigupta an chhuahsan aṭanga kum zali leh sawmriat, Israel-te chunga Solomona a lal kum lina thla hnihna Ziv thlaah Solomona chuan Lalpa Tempul a sa ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Solomonan Lalpa tâna Tempul a sak chu a dung tawng sawmruk, a vâng tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a sân lam chu tawng sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tempul Hmun Thianghlim ber hma lamah chuan pindan hmasa, a in vâng tawng sawmhniha zau leh a thûk lam tawng sâwm a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tempul bangah chuan tukverh tê tak tê tê a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tempul bang rinchhanin pindan chhâwng thuma sâng a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnuaihnung ber chu tawng ngaa zau a ni a, a laita chu tawng ruk, a chhâwng chung ber chu tawng sariha zau a ni. Tempul pindan chungnung bangte chu a hnuai bang aiin a pan zâwk avângin kalkhangte chu a chhawrdawhah a innghat mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tempul sakna lungte chu lunglâkna hmuna chher sa vek a nih avângin Tempul sak lai chuan tuboh ri te, thîrkhen ri te hriat tûr a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In chhâwng hnuai ber luhna chu Tempul chhim lamah a siam a, chhâwng hnihna leh chhâwng thumna kal nân kailâwn a dawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Tempul chu an sa zo ta a, a chhûng lam chu sidar thingphelin a thuah vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tempul bang nghênga pindan sak chu chhâwng tin tawng ngaa sâng a ni; chhâwng tinah sidar kalkhang a hmang vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Solomona hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tûnah Tempul chu i sa zo ta a, ka dân leh ka thuhriattîr i pawisaka, ka thupêkte i zawm chuan i pa Davida hnêna ka thutiam kha i lakah ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel-te zîngah ka awm ang a, ka mi Israel-te chu ka thlahthlam lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomona chuan Tempul chu a sa zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tempul chhûng bang thuah nân sidar thingphel a hmang a, a chhuat aṭanga a chung thlengin thingphel a bel vek a, a chhuat atân fâr thingphel a phah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pindan chhûngril Hmun Thianghlim Ber an tih chu Tempul kawmchâr lamah tawng sawmhnih bialin a siam a, a chhuat aṭanga a chung thlengin a chhûng lamah sidar thingphelin a thuah vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber luh dâwn chiaha pindan chu tawng sawmli-a sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tempul chhûng thuahna sidar thingphelah chuan pangpâr kuhmûm lem leh a pâr parh lem an ker a, a chhûng chu sidar thinga chei vek a nih avângin a bang lung chu a lang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tempul chhûng hmun ril ber chu Lalpa Thuthlung Bâwm dahna atân a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu pindan chu tawng sawmhnih bial, a sân lam tawng sawmhnih bawk a ni. A chhûng chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin a luan a. Sidar thinga siam maichâm pawh chu rangkachakin a luan bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomona chuan Tempul chhûng chu rangkachakin a luan vek a, pindan chhûngril ber luhna kawngkaah chuan rangkachak khaidiat a thlung a, kawngka pawh chu rangkachaka luan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tempul chhûng lam zawng zawng leh Hmun Thianghlim Bera maichâm awm chu rangkachaka luan vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Berah chuan Oliv thinga siam cherub thla pahnih nei, tawng sâwma sâng ve ve a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cherub pakhat thla chu tawng ngaa sei a ni a, a thla lehlam pawh tawng ngaa sei a ni. A thla hmâwr lehlam aṭanga a hmâwr lehlam chu tawng sâwm a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cherub-te chu an pianhmang leh an lenzâwng a inang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tawng sâwma sâng ve ve an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tempul chhûng Hmun Thianghlim Berah chuan Cherub-te chu a dah tlar a, an thla an zâr duai a. Cherub thla pahnih chu a laiah a insi a, Cherub pakhat zâwk thla lehlam hmâwr chuan bang a dek a, Cherub dang thla lehlam hmâwr chuan bang lehlam a dek bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chûng Cherub-te chu rangkachaka luan vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tempul chhûng lam bangah te, Hmun Thianghlim Ber chhûng lam bangah te chuan Cherub lem te, tûm thing lem te, pangpâr lem te an ker thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber chhuat leh pindan dang chhuatte pawh chu rangkachaka luan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlim Ber luhna kawngkhârte chu oliv thinga siam a ni. Kawngka lu chung chu a zum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Oliv thingin kawngkhâr pahnih a siam a, Cherub lem te, tûm thing lem te, pangpâr lem te kerin a cheimawi a. Cherub lem te, tûm thing lem te, pang pâr lem te chu rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tempul chhûng luhnaah chuan kawngkhâr kil li nei, kil tin inchen vek, oliv thingin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kawngkhâr kaihthleh theih pahnih fâr thingin a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chûngah chuan cherub thla nei lem te, tûm thing lem te, pangpâr lem te a ker a, rangkachakin a luan leh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tempul hma lamah chuan kawt zâwl chhûngril zâwk a siam a, lungchher chhâwng thum leh sidar thingphêk thuah khatin a hung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Solomona lal kum lina, Ziv thlaah Tempul lung chu an phûm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Solomona lal kum sâwm leh pakhatna, thla riatna, Bul thlaah ruahman lâwk ang ngeiin Tempul chu an sa zo a ni. Kum sarih chhûng an sa a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chuan a in chu kum sâwm leh pathum chhûngin a sa zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In lian tak, ‘Lebanon Ngawpui In’ a tih chu a dung tawng za, a vâng tawng sawmnga, a sân lam tawng sawmthumin a sa bawk a. Sidar ban tlar thum a phun a, a chungah sidar liang a chhuang a, a siling chu sidar thing a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlar khatah ban sâwm leh panga zêl a awm a, ban sawmli leh panga a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sâng takah tukverh tlar thum a siam a, a bang chhak lama mi leh thlang lama mi chu a inzâwn vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukverh leh kawngkate pawh kil li nei, intiat vekin a siam a, hma lama tukverh tlar thumte leh hnung lama tukverh tlar thumte chu a inzâwn thliah bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ban neiin hulhliap a siam a, a dung tawng sawmnga, a vâng tawng sawmthum a ni, bathlâr ban neiin a siam bawk a, a luhna kailâwn nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rorêlna pindan a siam leh a, chutah chuan lalṭhutthlêng a hûng a, chu chu rorêlna hmun a ni. A chhuat aṭanga a chung thlengin sidar thingphelin a thuah vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rorêlna in hnungah chuan ama chênna tûr, in dang a sak ang bawkin a sa leh a. Tin, a nupui, Farawa fanu pualin in dang a sa bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng in zawng zawng chu, a kawtzâwl chenin, a lungphûm aṭanga liang thlengin lung ṭha chi a ni a, lungkhura chher, a chhûng lam leh pâwn lam mâm taka nawh sa vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A lungphûm atân lung ṭha chi, lian pui puia chher tawng sâwm te, tawng riatte a hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A chungah chuan lung ṭha chi, a tâwk chiah tûra chher sa a rem chho va, liang atân sidar thing a hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kawtlai zau tak chu a vêlin lungchher chhâwng thum leh sidar thing thuah khatin a hung a, Lalpa Tempul kawtzâwl anga chei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Tura khuaa mi pakhat, Hurama chu a chah a. A nu chu Naftali hnam, hmeithai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa chu Tura khaw mi, dâr chhûn thiam tak a ni. Hurama pawh chu mi themthiam, dâr chi hrang hrang rei tak lo chher tawh a ni. Lal Solomona hnênah a lo kal a, thawh tûr an ruatsak zawng zawng chu a thawhsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hurama chuan dâr ban pahnih, tawng sâwm leh pariata sâng ve ve, teh kuala tawng sâwm leh pahniha lian, Tempul luhna bulah a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ban chhîpah chuan dârin lu bâwk a siam leh a, ban lu bâwk chu tawng nga laia sâng a ni ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ban lu bâwk chu khaidiat lem, vawi sariha vêtin a cheimawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Theibuhfai lem tlar, ban lu bâwkah chuan a siam chhuak ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hulhliap ban lu bâwkte chu lili pâr ang maiin a mawi a, tawng lî-a sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ban lu bâwk pahnih, mûm pul, khaidiat lema veh chhuah chung chiahah chuan theibuhfai lem zahnih a kual chhuakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tempul hma lama dâr ban pahnih a hûnte chu a chhim lama mi chu Jakin ban an ti a, hmâr lama mi chu Boaza ban an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ban lu bâwk chu lili pâr anga mawi a ni. Chutiang chuan bante chu a siam zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hurama chuan dâr tuizêm lian pui a siam bawk a, a laia hawlh tlangin tawng sâwm a ni a, a thûk zâwng chu tawng nga a ni. A tlânga teh kualin tawng sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tlâng hnuai chu kuhmûm lem hian a vêl chhuak a, kuhmûm lem chu tlar hnihin a awm a; chûng chu a tuizêm nên a ruala chhûn nghâl vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuizêm chu bâwngpa lem sâwm leh pahnih chungah a innghat a, pathumin hmâr lam a hawi a, pathumin chhim lam a hawi a, pathumin chhak lam a hawi a, pathumin thlang lam a hawi a. An chungah chuan tuizêm chu a hûng a, bâwngpa lem mawng lam chu a inchhawn vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuizêm chhah zâwng chu kutphah bawk a ni, a kotlâng chu no tlâng ang a ni, lili kuhmûm angin a mûm a, tui litar sîngli lai dawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hurama chuan dârin bâwm nawrlirh sâwm a siam a, kil li nei, tawng li bial a ni a. A sân lam chu tawng thum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A bang chuan kâwm a nei ṭheuh va, a bangah chuan sakeibaknei lem te, bâwngchal lem te, cherub lem te a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kâwm chung lam leh hnuai lam sakeibaknei leh bâwng lem inkâr chu an chhûng vial chiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bâwm tinah chuan a ke pali, dâra siam, dâr tlâwn vuah a awm ṭheuh va. Bâwm chhûng kil tinah tuizêm inhûnna tûr dâr, inherh chiata chhûn a awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bâwm chhînah chuan tuizêm chelhtu tûr dâr belvâl a awm a; tuizêm chu a chung lamah tawng khat a lawr a, bâwm chhûngah chuan tawng khat leh a chanve a pil a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ke palite chu dâr a ni a, tawng khat leh a chanve hawlh tlang a ni, a bâwm bang hnuaia awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A ke vir chu sakawrtawlailîr ke ang a ni; a vuahna bâwr te, a kual dotu te leh a ke kual te chu dâr veka siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A bâwm kil tinah chuan, bâwm nêna inzawm, dotu pali a awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tlâng vêttu tawng chanvea hlai a awm bawk. A dotu bante chu a bâwm bangte nên chhûn zawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A donaah te leh a bâwm bangah te chuan hmun âwl lai apiangah cherub lem te, sakeibaknei lem te, tûm thing lem te an chuantîr zêl a, a lem huam loh chin a tlâng te chu inherh chiatin an siam zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Huraman chutiang chuan nawrlirh bâwm sâwm a siam a, an inang vek a, an intiat vek bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hurama chuan tuizêm sâwm, nawrlirh bâwm tina dah tûr a siam bawk a. Tuizêm chu a bial a, tawng li hawlh tlang a ni a, tui litar zariat vêl a dawng ṭheuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nawrlirh panga chu Tempul chhim lamah a dah a, panga dang chu hmâr lamah. Dâr tuizêm kha Tempul chhimchhak kilah an hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hurama chuan insilna bêl te, vutlawh te, maihûn te a siam a. Tichuan, Lalpa Tempul atâna lal Solomona a siamsak zawng zawng chu a peih ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Dâr ban pahnih, ban lu bâwk, no bial anga kum te, ban lu bâwka khaidiat lem tlar hnih awm kual te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />ban lu bâwka theibuhfai lem zali, tlar hnih, za zêla kual chhuak te chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Bâwm nawrlirh sâwm leh tuizêm sâwm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />bâwngpa sâwm leh pahnih chunga dâr tuizêm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />bêl te, vutlawh te, thîrkutte nên; Lalpa Tempul bungrua Huraman lal Solomona a siamsak zawng zawng chu dâr tle mia siam vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lal chuan Jordan phaizâwl Sukoth leh Zereda inkâr bellei hmunah chûng chu a chhûntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hêng bungbêlte hi a tam êm avângin Solomona chuan bûk lovin a dah mai a, a zât hriat a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Solomonan Lalpa Tempul bungbêl a siamte chu rangkachak maichâm te, Pathian hnêna hlan tûr chhang serh dahna tûr rangkachak dawhkân te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam khâwnvâr dahna zâr sarih nei sâwm, Hmun Thianghlim Ber hma lamah a hûng a, chhim lamah panga, hmâr lamah panga, pangpâr te, khâwnvâr te, chaicheh te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Rangkachak no te, khâwnvâr huh hlumna te, rimtui hâlna berhbu te, meilawh te nên rangkachak vekin a siam a. Tempul Hmun Thianghlim Ber leh pâwn lam pindan indaidanna kawngkhâr leh a kalhnate chu rangkachaka siam vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Lal Solomonan Lalpa Tempul a sak zawh hnu chuan a pa Davidan Lalpa tâna a lo serh hran tawh tangkarua te, rangkachak te, bungbêl te chu Tempul sum dahnaah chuan a dah ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Israel upate, hnam hruaitute chu Davida khawpui Zion aṭanga Jerusalem, a chênna hmuna Thuthlung Bâwm chu laa Tempul-a dah sawn tûrin a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu thla sarihna, Ethanim thlaah kût hmang tûrin lal Solomona hnênah chuan an lo kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel upate an lo thlen chuan puithiamte chuan Bâwm chu an zâwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa Bâwm te, Inbiakna puan in te, bungbêl thianghlim zawng zawng te chu tempulah chuan an dah ta a. Puithiam leh Levia chite chuan an zâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi, a hnêna awm zawng zawng chu lal Solomona hovin Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah chuan an lo kal khâwm a; berâm leh bâwng chhiar sên rual lohvin an inthawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puithiamho chuan Lalpa Bâwm chu Tempul chhûngah an zâwn lût a, a awmna tûra ruat Hmun Thianghlim Berah, cherub thlazâr hnuaiah chuan an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cherub thlazâr chuan Bâwm leh a zâwnfung chu a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zâwnfung hmâwr chu Hmun Thianghlim Ber kawngka hmazâwn taka din chuan a lang thei, pâwn lam aṭang erawh chuan a lang thei lo. A zâwnfungte chu tûn thlengin a la awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bâwm chhûngah chuan eng mah dang a awm lo, Israel fate Aigupta ram aṭanga an lo chhuah laia Horeb tlânga Lalpa Thuthlung ziakna lungphêk pahnih Mosia dah chauh kha a awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiamhovin Hmun Thianghlim Ber an chhuahsan veleh Lalpa Tempul chu chhûmin a khuh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhûm avâng chuan puithiamte chuan rawng an bâwl thei ta lo va, Lalpa ropuina chuan Tempul chu a tikhat vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Solomona chu a ṭawngṭai a, “ Lalpa chuan, ‘Thim chhah mupah ka awm ang,’ i lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempul ropui tak i tân ka sa ta e, kumkhuaa i chên nân a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chu chutah chuan an ding a, Solomona chuan an lam a hawi a, Pathian malsâwmna a dîlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetiangin a sawi a: “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu fak rawh u, ani chuan ka pa Davida hnêna a thutiam a rawn tihpuitlin tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Ka mite Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuah ni aṭang khân tûn thlengin Israel khawpui khawiah mah min biakna tûr Tempul sakna hmun ka la thlang lo. David, nang erawh hi chu ka mite rorêltu atân ka thlang che a ni, a tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solomona chuan a sawi zêl a, “Ka pa Davida khân Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian biak nân Tempul sak a lo tum ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa chuan ka pa Davida hnênah, ‘Tempul min saksak i tum ṭhîn a, i ti ṭha e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahse, nang chuan ka Tempul i sa lo vang; i fapa, i rîla rah ngei chuan ka Tempul chu a sa zâwk ang,’ a ti a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan thu a lo tiam tawh chu a vawng reng a, ka pa Davida ai ka awh a, tûnah Israel-te lal ka lo ni ta a, Lalpa lo tiam tawh angin Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chibai bûk nân Tempul chu ka sa ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm, min thlahtute Aigupta ram ata an lo chhuaha Lalpa nên thu an thlun ziakna lungphêk pawh tempulah dah a ni ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomona chu mipui hma lam, Lalpa maichâm bulah a ding a, bân phar chungin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, chung lam vânah te, hnuai lam leiah te, nang ang Pathian dang rêng an awm lo. I mite nêna i thuthlung chu i vawng reng a; tih tak zeta i thu an zawm phawt chuan i hmangaihzia i lantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka pa Davida hnênah i thutiam i hlen a, vawiin hian i tipuitling ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa Israel-te Pathian, ka pa Davida khân i dânte a pawisak ṭhin anga a thlahten an pawisak ve phawt chuan a thlah pakhat tal chu Israel lalṭhutthlêngah an ṭhu reng ang tih i tiam pawh kha hlen bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka pa Davida, i chhiahhlawh hnêna i tiam zawng zawng kha, Aw Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian, vawiina i tihhlawhtlin ang hian tihlawhtling zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mahse, nang Pathian meuh chu lei mite zîngah i chêng duh ngût ang emaw chu? Vânah meuh pawh i leng lo a ni a, ka Tempul sakah hian i leng dâwn em ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, i chhiahhlawh ka ni a, vawiina i hnêna ka dîl hi ngaithla la, ka ngen hi min phalsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />He Tempul, nangmah biak nâna i thlan hi, a chhûn a zânin vêng la, he Tempul lam hawia ka ṭawngṭai hi lo ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭai ngaithla la, i mite pawh he Tempul lam hawia an ṭawngṭai chuan ngaithla ang che. I chênna vân aṭangin lo hria la, min ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tu pawh, thil tisuala puh, i maichâm hmaa a lo kala, a tihsual lohzia chian nâna chhia a rawn chham chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, i chhiahhlawhte chungthu chu dik takin rêlsak la, thil tisualtu chu a phu angin hrem la, pawi khawih lo chu chhuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I chunga an sual avânga, i mi Israel-te chu hmêlmaten an hneha, i lam an lo hawia, he Tempula inngaitlâwma ngaihdam an rawn dîl chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />vân aṭangin lo ngaithla ang che. I mite sualna chu ngaidam la, an thlahtute hnêna i pêk ramah hian hruai kîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I miten thil an tihsual avânga khua i khêntîra, an sual sima he Tempul lam hawia an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />vân aṭangin lo ngaithla ang che. Lalte sualna leh Israel mite sualna ngaidam la, thil dik tih zirtîr ang che. Tichuan, Aw Lalpa , i mite chên rengna tûra i pêk ramah hian ruah sûrtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />He ramah hian ṭâm a tlâka, hri a lêna, thli lumin thlai a chhêm chhiata, khaute a puana, hmêlmaten i mite an rawn do hun leh damloh hritlân an tawh hunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina chu lo ngaithla ang che. I mi Israel tu pawh, sim takzeta he Tempul lam hawia bânphara a ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />an ṭawngṭaina chu lo ngaithla ang che, i chênna vân aṭangin lo ngaithla la, ngaidam la, ṭanpui ang che. Nang chauhvin mihring ngaihtuahna chhûngril i hre thei a. Mi tin an phu tâwk zêlin rêlsak la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />tichuan, he ram, kan pute hnêna i pêkah hian an dam chhûngin i mite chuan i thu an zâwm zêl dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />“Hnam dang, Israel mi ni lo, ram hla taka awmte pawhin i ropuizia leh i thiltihtheihzia an hriata, nangmah be tûra an lo kala, he Tempula an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />an dîl chu ngaithla la, i chênna vân aṭang chuan lo ngaithla la, an ngen chu tihsak ang che. Tichuan, khawvêla mi zawng zawngin i mi Israel-te ang bawkin an hria ang chia, i thu an zâwm dâwn nia. He Tempul ka sak hi nangmah chibai bûkna hmun a ni tih an hria ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An hmêlmate do tûra i mite an chhuaha, khawi aṭang pawha i thlan he khua emaw, i tâna ka Tempul sak lam hawi emawa an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />an dîl chu lo hria la, vân aṭangin ngaithla la, an hmêlmate hnehtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“I miten i laka thil an tihsuala, (tu mah thil tisual lo an awm si lo) i thinura an hmêlmate i hnehtîra, sala an hruaiin an hruaina ram chu hla hle mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />i mite ṭawngṭai chu ngaithla ang che. Chu ramah chuan an sual an sima, an sualna leh an khawlohna thupha an chawi chuan aw Lalpa , an ṭawngṭai ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Chu rama an awm hnua an sual an sim takzeta, inchhîra an thlahtute hnêna i pêk ram lam te, i khawpui thlan lam te, i tâna ka sak he Tempul lam hawi tea an ṭawngṭai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />lo ngaithla la, i chênna vânsâng aṭang chuan lo hria la, an chungah zahngai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />I mite sualna leh an bawhchhiatna zawng zawng chu ngaidam la, an hmêlmate chu an chungah ṭhat chhuahtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Rawhtuina mei, Aigupta ram aṭanga i hruai chhuah, nangma mite ngei an nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa , i mi Israel-te leh an lalte chungah zah ngai la, ṭanpui dîla an koh hun apiangah lo ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Anni chu khawvêl hnam zawng zawng ata i pual atân i thlang a, i chhiahhlawh Mosian kan pute Aigupta ram aṭanga a hruai chhuah lai khân an hnênah i sawi tawh si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Solomona chu Lalpa hnêna a ṭawngṭai zawh chuan bân phara a ṭawngṭaina hmun maichâm hma ata chu a lo ding chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Mipui pung khâwm zawng zawng tân Pathian malsâwmna ring takin a dîlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“A lo tiam tawh anga a mite hnêna remna petu Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se. A chhiahhlawh Mosia hmanga a thutiam hlu tak tak chu a vawng reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />kan pute hnêna a awm ṭhîn angin Lalpa kan Pathian chu kan hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />A thu awih thei tûrin min pui sela; tichuan, a duh angin kan nung ang a; kan pute hnêna dân leh thupêkte chu kan zâwm thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Lalpa , kan Pathian chuan kan ṭawngṭaina leh a hnêna kan dîlte chu hre reng rawh se. Israel-te leh an lalte khawngaih sela, an mamawh pe zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tichuan, khawvêla hnam tinin Lalpa chauh hi Pathian a ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Nangni, a mite u, Lalpa , kan Pathian lakah rinawm takin awm ula, a dân leh a thupêkte chu vawiina in zâwm ang hian zâwm zêl ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Lal Solomona leh chuta Israel mi awm zawng zawng chuan Lalpa hnênah thilhlan an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Remna thilhlan atân bâwngpa sînghnih leh sânghnih leh berâm nuaikhat leh sînghnih an hlân a. Tichuan, lal leh Israel mipui chuan Tempul chu an hawng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Chumi ni bawk chuan Solomonan tual hung chhûng kawtlai, Tempul kawta mi chu a hawng bawk a. Hâlral thilhlan te, buhbâl thilhlan te leh remna thilhlana ran thau te chu a hâl a. Dâr maichâm a siam kha hêng zawng zawng hlan nân hian a tê lutuk a, maichâma leng lo chu tualah chuan a hâl mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Lal Solomona leh Israel mipui chuan tempulah chuan Bâwkte kût, ni sarih chhûng an hmang a. Chutah chuan Israel ram hmâr tâwp Hamath kalkhân aṭanga Israel ram chhim lam Aigupta lui inkâra mi zawng zawng an lo kal khâwm a, mi an tam kher mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />A ni riat ni chuan Solomona chuan mite chu an in lamah a hawtîr a, Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh Davida leh a mite chu mal a sâwm avângin hlim takin an ṭin a, Solomona chu an fak a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lal Solomonan Tempul te, lal in te, in dang te a sak zawh hnu chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gibeona a awm lai ang khân Lalpa chu a hnênah a inlâr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I ṭawngṭai ka lo ngaithla a, he Tempul i sak hi kumkhuaa min biakna hmun atân ka thlang ta e. Ka vil ang a, ka vêng reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I pa Davida angin rinawm tak leh dik taka ka rawng i bâwl a, ka dânte leh i hnêna ka thupêkte i zawm chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />i pa Davida hnêna ka thutiam, a thlahte chu Israel-te lalah an ṭang reng ang, tia ka tiam kha ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang leh i thlahten min zui in bânsana, in tâna ka dân leh thupêkte hi in zawm lohva, pathian dangte in biak erawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ka mi Israel-te chu an tâna ka pêk ram ata ka paih chhuak ang. He Tempul, min biakna hmun atâna ka tihthianghlim tawh pawh hi ka rauhsan ang. Khawvêla hnam tinin Israel-te chu an hmusitin an nuihzat ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />he Tempul hi a chhe vek ang a, a kianga kal apiangin mak ti takin, ‘Engtizia nge Lalpa hian he ram leh he Tempul hi heti taka a sawisak le?’ an ti ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mite chuan, ‘An thlahtute Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu Lalpa an Pathian chu an kalsan atin alâwm maw le, pathian dangte an vuan a, an rawngte an bâwlsan avângin Lalpa hian a sawisa a nih hi,’ tiin an chhâng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa Tempul leh ama in chu kum sawmhnih chhûng a sa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tura lal Hirama chuan sidar thing te, fâr thing te, rangkachak te, a mamawh apiang hêng in sak nân hian a pe a. In sak a zawh hnu chuan Lal Solomona chuan Hirama chu Galili ram bial chhûnga khaw sawmhnih a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hirama chuan khuate chu a va hmuh chuan a lâwm lo hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, Solomona hnênah, “Unaupa, hetiang hi a ni maw min pêk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eng atân maha hman tlâk loh, Kabul ram a nih hi,” a ti a. Tûn thlengin chu hming chu a pu hlen ta a. Hirama chuan Solomona chu rangkachak kg. sângli lai a lo thawn tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Tempul te, ama in te, khawpui chhak lam khuar hnawh khat tûr te, kulh bang siam tûr tein hnathawktu rawih luih pâwl a siam a. Tin, hêng khua Hazor te, Megido te, Gezer te hi a din ṭha bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aigupta lal Farawa khân Gezer khua a rûn a, a hâl vek a, khawpuia chêng chu a that vek bawk a. A fanu, Solomona nupui chu a chhawmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solomona chuan a din ṭha a; hna thawka a chhawr luihte chu Beth-horon chuanhnuai te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Baalat khua te, Judai ram thlalêra Tamar khua te a din ṭhattîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kudâm awmna khua te, sakawr leh sakawr-tawlailîr dahna khua te, Jerusalem-ah te, Lebanon-ah te leh ram chhûng hmun tinah sak ṭûl a tih zawng zawng chu a sa zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hêng hnam Amor te, Hit te, Periz te, Hiv te, Jebus mite hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel-ten Kanan ram an luh khân an that vek lo va, Solomona khân hnathawka chhawr luih atân an thlahte chu a hmang a, tûn thlengin bawih an ni ta zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Solomona chuan Israel mi tu mah bawihah a chhawr lo, sipai atân te, hotu atân te a chhawr thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Solomona in sak hrang hranga mi chhawrte enkawltu mi zanga leh sawmnga an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Solomona nupui Aigupta lal fanu chu Davida khawpui aṭangin a puala in a sakah chuan a sawn chho va, chumi hnu chuan khawpui chhak lam ruam chu a chhûng khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa tâna maichâm a siamah chuan hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan, kum khatah vawi thum a hlân a. Lalpa tân rimtui a hâl bawk a. Tichuan, Tempul sak chu a zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Edom rama Eloth kiang, Agaba litengsâwl Ezion-geber khuaah lawng rual a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Hirama chuan a lawng mite chu Solomona mite pui tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ofir ramah an kal a, rangkachak kg. sângkhat leh zali an va la a. Solomona chu an rawn pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Seba lalnuin Solomona hming thanzia a lo hriatin thu har tak tak zâwta fiah tûrin Jerusalem-ah a lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭhuihruai tam tak a nei a, sanghâwngsei tam tak a hruai a; mosola te, lungmantam te, rangkachak te a keng ṭeuh bawk a. Solomona nên an inhmuh chuan zawh tûr a neih zawng zawng chu a zâwt vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zawh apiang Solomona chuan a chhâng thei zêl a, chhân harsa tih rêng a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Seba lalnu chuan Solomona finzia chu a hria a, a in sak ropuizia te a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Solomona ei tûr an rawn hlui te, a chhiahhlawhho awmna in te, lal hna thawktu hna insem dân te, an thawmhnaw hâk mawizia te, a viltute inchei mawizia te, Tempula hâlral thilhlan a hlan hnemzia te a han hmuh chuan mak a ti a, awm ngaihna rêng a hre ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalnu chuan Solomona hnênah, “I thil tihte leh i finzia te kan rama ka lo hriat kha a lo dik ngei a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lo kal a, keimah ngeiin ka rawn hmuh hma chuan an sawi chu ka lo awih ṭhîn lo va; mahse, i finzia leh i hausakzia hi a zâtve pawh an lo sawi hlei nêm, an sawi ai daihin a ropui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I nupuite chu an va nihlawh êm! I chhiahhlawh, ni tin i bula awma i finzia ngaithla ṭhînte pawh hi an va nihlawh êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I Pathian, Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se. Ani chu i chungah a lâwm a, Israel-te lalah a siam che a nih hi. I Pathian chuan Israel-te a hmangaih a, dik taka an chunga rorêltu atân lalah a duh che a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thilpêk tûr a ken chu a pe a, rangkachak kg. sângli chuang, mosola tam tak, lungmantam pawh tam tak a pe a ni. Mosola thil rimtui chutiang zât chu tûn hma zawng zawngin a la dawng ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hirama lawng rual, Ofir ram aṭanga rangkachak rawn phurte chuan almug thing leh lungmantam an rawn phur ṭeuh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lal chuan chûng thing chu Lalpa Tempul leh lal in hung nân a hmang a, zaipâwl ṭingṭangte leh perhkhuang siam nân a hmang bawk a. Chutianga tam almug thing chu Israel ramah lâkluh a la ni ngai lo, hmuh pawh an hmu leh tawh ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal Solomona chuan Seba lalnu chu a dîl leh a duh apiang a pe a; chu bâkah, a thil rawn kensak do lêt nân thil tam tak a lo pe ve a. Tichuan, a ṭhuihruaite nên an ram lamah an haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Solomona chuan kum tin rangkachak kg. sîngthum bûk lai a dawng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sumdâwngtute leh dâwrkaiten chhiah an pe a, Arabia lalte leh Israel ram bial tina ram awptuten rangkachak leh tangka an pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Solomona chuan phaw lian pui pui, rangkachak den phêk zahnih a siam a, phaw pakhatah rangkachak kg. sarih zêl a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Phaw tê deuh, rangkachak kg. hnih vêl zêla luan zathum lai a siam bawk a, phâwte chu ‘Lebanon ngawpui In’ an tih pindanah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng ropui, sainghovin a siam a, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêng lâwn chhohna kailâwn, rahka paruk nei a siam a, vawnbân a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rahka sîr tawnah chuan sakeibaknei lem a dintîr a, a vaiin sâwm leh pahnih a nih chu. Lalṭhutthlêng hnung lamah chuan bâwngpa lu lem a awm a, a sîr tuakah chuan sakeibaknei lem a awm bawk a. Chutiang khawpa lalṭhutthlêng ropui chu khawii ramah mah a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomona no chu rangkachak vek a ni. ‘Lebanon ngawpui In’ an tih pindan chhûnga an thil eina bungbêlte phei chu rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam a ni. Solomona hun lai chuan tangkaruate hi an ngaihlu vak lo va, engah mah an hmang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lawng rual a nei bawk a, Lal Hirama lawng rualte nên a inkawp a, Tarsis-ah te kalin kum thum danah an lo haw a, rangkachak te, tangkarua te, saingho te, zâwng te, ârâwn te an rawn hâwn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal Solomona chu khawvêl lal dang zawng zawng aiin a hausa a, a fing zâwk bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathianin a hnêna finna a pêk chu zir tûrin khawvêl ram tin aṭangin mi an lo kal huai huai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A hnêna lo kal apiangte chuan tangkarua leh rangkachaka thil siam te, puan te, râlthuam te, mosola te, sakawr te, sakawr puakphur chi te an rawn pe zut zut a. Hetiang hian kum tin an rawn pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomona chuan sakawrtawlailîr sângkhat leh zali leh sakawr chungchuang mi sîngkhat leh sânghnih lai a nei a. A ṭhen Jerusalem-ah a dah a, a dang chu khawpui hmun hrang hrangah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A lal chhûng chuan tangkarua chu lungtê ang maiin Jerusalem-ah chuan a tam a, sidar thing pawh tlâng bulṭhut khawthlang lama theipui thing ang maiin a tam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal mi rawihte chuan Musri leh Kue aṭangin sakawr an tawlh chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aigupta rama sakawr-tawlailîr an tawlh chhuak bawk. Hit mite leh Suria lalte hnênah sakawr-tawlailîr pakhat tangkaraw tlang zaruk leh sakawr pakhat tangkaraw za leh sawmnga zêlin an hralh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomona chuan Farawa fanu chang lo pawh hnam dang nula a hmangaih a, nupui atân Moab mi te, Amon mi te, Edom mi te, Sidon mi te leh Hit mi te pawh a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te hnênah, “Hnam dang nulate nupuiah nei suh u, an pathiante in zui palh ang e,” a ti chungin nupuiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Solomona chuan lal fanu zasarih nupuiah a nei a, hmei zathum a nei bawk a; a nupuite chuan ani chu an hruai kawi ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lo tar hnu chuan a nupuite chuan an pathian lamah an hruai ta a, a pa Davida ang khân Lalpa , a Pathian lakah a rinawm ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sidon mite pathiannu Astarte leh Amon mite pathian tenawm tak Milkoma te chu a zui ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa mit hmuhin thil sual a ti a, a pa Davida ang khân a rinawm ve ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem chhak tlângah Moab mite pathian tenawm tak Khemosa biakna a siam a, Amon mite pathian tenawm tak Milkoma biakna a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam dang mi nupuia a neihte tân an pathian hnêna rimtui hâlna leh inthawina hmunte a siamsak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu, a hnênah vawi hnih lai a inlâr a, hnam dang pathiante be lo tûra a tih pawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomona chuan Lalpa thu a zâwm lo va, Pathian a hawisan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chu Solomona chungah a thin a ur ta hle a, a hnênah, “Nang nêna kan thuthlung i bawhchhe lui a, ka thupêk i zâwm loh avângin ram chu ka chhuhsak ang che a, i hote zînga mi pakhat ka pe ang tih ka hrilh a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, i pa Davida avâng khân i dam chhûng ni lovin i fapa rorêl chhûngin chu thil chu ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ram pum pui chu ka chhuhsak lo vang a, ka chhiahhlawh Davida leh ka tâna ka din Jerusalem avângin hnam khat chu a la chang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Solomona do tûrin Edom lal thlah Hadada chu a chawk tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûn hmain Davida leh Edom mite an indo va, Davida sipai hotu Joaba chu an mi thahte phûm tûrin a han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joaba leh a sipaite chu Edom ramah thla ruk an awm a, chumi chhûng chuan mipa zawng zawng an that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hadada chu a pa chhiahhlawhte nên Aigupta ramah an tlânchhia a, ani chu naupang tê a la ni nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Midian ram an chhuahsan a, Paran-ah an kal a, mi ṭhenkhatin an zâwm a. Aigupta-ah an chhuk a, lal chuan chênna tûr ram te, in te leh ei tûr te a lo pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hadada chuan lal rin a kai a, lalnu Tahpenesi laizâwn chu Aigupta lal chuan nupuiah a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nupui chuan fapa, Ganubata a hrinsak a, lal fapa dangte angin lalnu chuan a enkawl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Davida thih thu leh a sipai hotu Joaba thih thu Hadadan Aigupta ram aṭang chuan a lo hria a, lal hnênah chuan, “Kan ramah min hâwntîr tawh rawh le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Engah maw? Eng nge i tlâkchhama in rama hâwn i duh tâk mai le?” a ti a. Hadada chuan, “Eng mah tlâkchham ka nei lo; mahse, min hâwntîr mai teh,” a ti a. Edom lal Hadada chu Israel-te hmêlma tawh khirh ber a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathianin Eliada fapa Rezona chu Solomona a huattîr bawk a. Rezona chu a pa Hadadezera, Zoba lal hnên aṭangin a tlân bo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />helho hruaitu a lo ni ta a. Hei hi Davidan Hadadezera a hneh a, a hmêlma Suria-ho a thah chiam hnua thil thleng a ni. Rezona leh a mite chu an chhuak a, Damaska khuaah an awm a, a zuitute chuan Suria ram lal atân an ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Solomona dam chhûng zawng Israel-te hmêlma a lo ni ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Solomona dotu dang pakhat chu a ṭhuihruai zînga mi, Jeroboama, Nebata fapa, Efraim ram Israel khuaa mi a ni. A nu chu Zeruii, hmeithai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hel dân chu hetiang hi a ni. Solomonan Jerusalem chhak lam ruam a chhûng khat a, kulhte a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jeroboama chu tlangvâl fel tak leh taima tak a ni tih hriain Manasea bial leh Efraim bial chunga hna thawktu chhawr luihte enkawltu atân a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni khat chu Jerusalem aṭangin Jeroboama chu a lo kal a, Silo khua aṭanga lo kal zâwlnei Ahija nên ramhnuaiah an intâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahija chuan a kawrfual thar hâk chu a hlîp a, phel sâwm leh pahnihah a pawtthlêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboama hnênah, “Phel sâwm hi nei rawh; Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai teh, Solomona ram hi ka chhuhsak ang a, hnam sâwm hi ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida avâng leh Israel ram puma ka puala ka thlan Jerusalem avângin hnam khat chu a chang ve ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani chuan Sidon mite pathiannu Astarte te, Moab mite pathian Khemosa te, Amon mite pathian Milkoma te min zuisan a, a pa Davida angin ka dân leh thupêk a pawisa lo va, ka kawng a zawh lo va, ka mite hmuha thil dik a tih hek loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mahse, Solomona chu ram pum pui ka chhuhsak lo vang. Ka chhiahhlawh Davida, ka thlan leh ka dân leh thupêkte zâwmtu avângin a dam chhûng chuan ka laltîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A fapa kut ata ram chu ka chhuhsak ang a, hnam sâwm ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hnam khat erawh chu a fapa ka pe ang a, min biakna hmun atâna ka thlan Jerusalem khuaah Davida thlahte chuan ro an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nang erawh chu ram zau tak chungah ro i rêl ang a, Israel-te lalah i awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida anga ka thu zâwma, ka dân pawisaa, ka mithmuha ṭha taka i awm chuan i hnênah ka awm reng ang. Israel-te lalah ka siam ang che a, Davida hnêna ka tiam angin i thlahten i hnuah pawh ro an rêl zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Solomona sualna avângin Davida thlahte chu ka hrem dâwn, kumkhua erawh chuan ka hrem lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Solomona chuan Jeroboama chu thah a tum ta a, Jeroboama chu Aigupta lal Sisaka hnênah a tlân a, Solomona thih hma chuan a awm ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Solomona chanchin dang, a thiltihte leh a finna thute chu Solomona chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel ram pum puiah kum sawmli chhûng Jerusalem-ah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Solomona chu a thi a, a pa Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Rehoboama chu a hmunah a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rehoboama chu Sekem khuaah a kal a, chutah chuan lala siam tûrin Israel-ho hmâr lama awmte chu an lo pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama chu Solomona hlauvin Aigupta ramah a tlân bo va, a thih thu a hriatin a lo haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmâr lama Israel-te chuan an va pun a, Rehoboama hnênah chuan an kal ho ta a, a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I pa khân min chhawr nasa hle a, kan phur a tirit êm êm a, nang chuan min chhawr nêpin kan phur min tihzânsak deuh la, i khua leh tuiah kan awm ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rehoboama chuan, “Ni thum hnuah lo kal leh ang che u,” a ti a. Mite chu an ṭîn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama chuan a pa Solomona dam laia a bula awm ṭhîn upate chu a râwn a, “Hêng mite hi engtia chhân tûr nge ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hêng mite hi ṭha taka enkawl i duh chuan an dîl hi ṭha takin chhâng la; tichuan, i lakah an rinawm kumkhua ang,” tiin an chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Upaho thurâwn chu a pawm duh lo va, tlangvâl, ama rualpui, a kawm ṭhînte chu a râwn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Hêng mi, kan phur min tihzânsak deuh rawh titute hi engtin nge ka chhân ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A rualpui tlangvâlho chuan, “Hêngho, ‘I pain kan phur a tirit êm a, min tihzânsak rawh,’ titute hi heti hian chhâng mai rawh: ‘ka kutzungtê pawh hi ka pa kâwng ai chuan a khauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka pain in phur a tirit hle a nih chuan kei chuan ka belhchhah ang. Tiangin a vua che u a, kei chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrem ang che u,’ ti ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni thum hnuah chuan Jeroboama leh Israel mite chu Rehoboama sawi ang khân an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal chuan upaho thurâwn kha a zâwm duh lo va, mite chu ram takin a lo bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlangvâlte thurâwn ang khân mite hnênah chuan, “Ka pa khân in phur a tirit hle maw? Kei chuan ka belhchhah ang. Tiangin a vua che u a, kei chuan khawmualkaikuangin ka hrem ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Silo khuaa zâwlnei Ahijan Nebata fapa Jeroboama hnêna a sawi a thlen theih nân Lalpa chuan a tihtîr a ni. Hei vâng hian lal chuan mipuite chu a lo chhâwn ṭha duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite chuan lalin an thu a ngaihsak lo tih an hriatin lal chu an chhâng a, “Davida ramah chan eng nge kan neih ve le? Jesaia thlahte zîngah chanvo eng nge kan neih? Davida thlahte chu an awm awmin awm rawh se,” an ti a. Israel mi zawng zawng chu in lamah an haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judai rama awm Israel mite chungah chauh chuan Rehoboama chu a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama chuan hna thawka chhawr luih pâwl hotu Adonirama chu Israel-ho ko tûrin a tîr a. Ani chu lungin an lo dêng hlum a. Chu veleh Rehoboama chu a tawlailîrah a chuang sawk sawk a, Jerusalem-ah a tlân haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, hmâr lam rama awm Israel mite chu Davida thlahte lakah tûn thlengin an hel ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel miten Jeroboama chu Aigupta ram aṭangin a lo haw tih an hriat chuan an pun khâwmnaah an sâwm a, ani chu Israel lalah an siam ta a. Juda hnam chauh chu Davida thlahte lamah an ṭang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lal Rehoboaman Jerusalem a thlen chuan Benjamin mi leh Juda mi zînga sipai ṭha ṭha nuaikhat leh sîngriat a khâwm a, hmâr lama awm Israel-te chu a thuhnuaia dah leh tûrin beih a tum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mahse, Pathian mi, Simeia hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda lal Solomona fapa Rehoboama hnênah te, Juda hnam pum pui leh Benjamin hnam hnênah te leh mi dang awm vete hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ‘in unau, Israel-te chu han bei suh u, in vaiin haw vek rawh u, an thil tih hi keima tih a ni e,’ tiin a sawi,” a ti a. Tichuan, Lalpa thupêk chu pawmin mahni inah an hâwng ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama chuan Efraim tlângrama Sekem khua chu kulhin a hung a, chutah chuan rei lo tê a awm a. A chhuak leh a, Penuel khua chu kulhin a hung leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jeroboama chuan, “Ram hi Davida chhûngten an chang leh mai ang a!” a ti rilru a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mite chu Jerusalem-ah Lalpa hnêna inthawi tûra an chhoh fo chuan an pu Rehoboama, Juda lal an bêl ang a, min that mai ang,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chutiang thil a ngaihtuah hnu chuan rangkachakin bâwngno lem pahnih a siam a. A mite hnênah chuan, “In tân Jerusalem-a chhoh fo a harsa si a, hei hi in pathian, Aigupta ata hruai chhuaktu che u kha a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pakhat chu Bethel-ah a dah a, pakhat chu Dan khuaah a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mite chuan Bethel leh Dan khuaahte kalin thil an lo tisual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jeroboama chuan tlângchhîpahte pathian biakna hmun a siam a, Levia chi pawh ni lo, a duh duh puithiamah a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Jeroboama chuan Judai rama kût an neih ṭhin angin thla riatna, ni sâwm leh panga ni chu kût ni atân a ruat a. Bethel-a maichâmah chuan rangkachaka siam bâwngno, ama kutchhuak hnênah a inthawi ta a. Tlângchhîp inthawina hmunah puithiamte a dah ang khân Bethel-ah chuan puithiamte a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thla riatna, ni sâwm leh panga ni, Israel mipui tâna kût ni a ruatsakah chuan Bethel-ah a kal a, maichâmah chuan inthawina a hlân a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboama chu thil hlân tûra maichâm hmaa a din lai chuan Lalpa mi tirh, zâwlnei, Judai ram aṭangin Bethel-ah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thupêkin zâwlnei chuan maichâm chu hetiangin a hau va: “Maichâm, maichâm, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Davida thlah aṭangin a hming Josia a lo piang ang a, i chunga milem pathian hnêna rimtui hâl ṭhîntu puithiamte chu a rawn sâm ang a, i chungah an ruhte nên a rawn hâl ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zâwlnei chuan a sawi zêl a, “He maichâm hi a phel phawk ang a, a chunga meivâpte pawh a la darh vek ang. Tichuan, Lalpa chuan keimah mi hmangin thu a sawi a ni tih in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bethel-a maichâm chu Pathian miin a hau tih lal Jeroboama chuan a hriatin maichâm bul aṭang chuan ani chu a kâwk a, “Man rawh u,” a ti a. Chu veleh lal bân chu a khawng a, a la thla thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Maichâm chu a phel phawk a, meivâpte chu Lalpa hminga zâwlneiin a sawi ang khân leiah a darh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal Jeroboama chuan zâwlnei hnênah, “Khawngaih takin, Lalpa , i Pathian hnênah ka bân damna hi min dilsak rawh,” a ti a. Zâwlnei chu Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a, lal bân chu a dam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chuan zâwlnei hnênah, “Ka inah lo kal la, ka hnênah eiin in la; tichuan, lâwmman ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zâwlnei chuan lal hnênah, “I sum zâtve pawh min pe dâwn mah la, i inah chuan ka kal lo vang a, i eng mah ka eiin ka in lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan eng mah eia in lo tûr leh ka lo kalna kawngah pawh kîr leh tawh lo tûrin min ti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Bethel panna, a lo kal kawnga hâwng lovin kawng dangah a hâwng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zâwlnei putar pakhat hi Bethel-ah chuan a awm a. A fapa pakhat chuan chumi nia Judai ram aṭanga zâwlnei lo kalin Bethel-a a thil tih leh lal Jeroboama hnêna a thu sawite chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâwlnei putar chuan a fate hnênah, “Khawii lamah nge a kal tâk?” a ti a. A kalna lam an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabengtung buatsaihsak tûrin a fate chu a ti a, an buatsaih zawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judai ram aṭanga zâwlnei lo kal chu a ûm ta a. Ani chu sasaw thing hlimah a lo ṭhu a, “Judai rama zâwlnei kha i ni em?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zâwlnei putar chuan, “Lo kal la, ka inah chaw rawn ei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Judai ram zâwlnei chuan, “I ruala lo kîr thei ka ni lo, i hnêna ei leh in thei ka ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan eng mah ei lo tûr leh ka lo kalna kawng ngaia kîr leh lo tûrin min ti tlat a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bethel zâwlnei putar chuan a hnênah, “Kei pawh nang ang bawkin zâwlnei ka ni a, Lalpa tirh Vântirhkohvin ka hnênah, ‘I ina eia in tûrin ani chu rawn hruai hâwng rawh,’ min ti a ni,” tiin dâwt a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judai ram zâwlnei chuan zâwlnei putar chu a zui a, a hnênah chaw a ei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chaw an kîl lai chuan Lalpa thu chu zâwlnei putar hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judai ram aṭanga zâwlnei hnênah chuan, “ Lalpa thu i zâwm lo va, a thupêk angin i ti hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I kîr leha, ei leh in lo tûra a tihna hmunah i eia i in avângin i thi ang a, i ruang chu in chhûngkaw thlânah phûm a ni ve lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An ei kham chuan zâwlnei putar chuan Judai ram zâwlnei tân a sabengtung a buatsaih a, a chuantîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kawngah chuan sakeibaknei a va tâwk a, a lo seh hlum a. A ruang chu kawngah a lo thal reng a, a sîrah sabengtung leh sakeibaknei chu an lo ding reng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kawnga mi lo kalin a ruang chu an va hmu a, sakeibaknei a bula ding nên chuan. Bethel khuaah an va tlân a, an thil hmuh chu an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A rawn hruai kîrtu zâwlnei putarin a lo hriat chuan, ‘E, Lalpa thupêk zâwm lotu zâwlnei kha a nih chu. Lalpa sawi tawh angin ani chu seh hlum tûrin sakeibaknei a tîr a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A fate hnênah chuan, “Ka sabengtung kha min han buatsaihsak teh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An buatsaih zawh chuan a tlân a, zâwlneipa ruang, kawnga lo thal reng leh a bula sabengtung leh sakeibaknei lo ding reng chu a va hmu a. Sakeibaknei chuan zâwlnei chu a ei lo va, sabengtung pawh a bei zui hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zâwlnei putar chuan a ruang chu a hlâwm a, sabengtung chuan a phur a, Bethel-a phûm tûrin a la ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zâwlnei putar chuan an chhûngkaw thlânah a phûm a, “Aw ka unaupa, ka unaupa,” tiin a fate nên an ṭah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An vui zawh chuan zâwlnei chuan a fate hnênah, “Ka thih hun chuan he thlânah hian min phûm ve ula, he mi bulah hian min zalh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa thupêka Bethel maichâm thu leh Samaria khawpuia inthawina hmun zawng zawng chungthu a sawite chu a lo thleng dik ngei dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama chuan a nun sual a sim duh chuang lo va; mi narân zîng aṭangin a maichâm dina rawngbâwl tûr puithiamte a ruat belh zêl a. Puithiam nih duh apiang hmunsânga rawngbâwl tûrin a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />He thil sual a tih hian ama chhiatna leh a thlahte thlenga boralna a thlen ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jeroboama fapa Abija chu a damlo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeroboama chuan a nupui hnênah, “Ka nupui i ni tih tu man an hriat theih loh nân inchei danglam la, Israel lal ka nih tûr thu min hrilhtu zâwlnei Ahija, Silo khuaa awm hnênah va kal teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhang tlâwn sâwm leh kêk tlêm azâwng leh khawizu ûm khat kensak la, naupang awm dân tûr hi a lo hrilh thei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hrilh ang chuan Jeroboama nupui chu Silo khuaa Ahija inah chuan a va kal a, Ahija chu a upat tawh avângin a mit a fiah tawh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Ahija hnênah, “Jeroboama nupui, a fa damlo chungchâng zâwt tûr chein a lo kal a, hetiangin lo chhâng ang che. Mi narân angin a inchei danglam a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kawngkaa lo lût thâwm Ahijan a hriat chuan, “Lo lût rawh, Jeroboama nupui i ni lâwm ni? Engtiziaa inchei danglam nge i nih? Chanchin lâwmawm lo tak ka lo hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kal la, Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian thuchhuak hi Jeroboama hnênah hetiangin va sawi rawh. ‘Mipui zîng ata ka chawisâng che a, ka mi Israel-te hruaitu atân ka dah che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Davida chhûngte ram ka chhuhsak a, ka pe che a. Mahse, ka chhiahhlawh Davida angin i awm lo va, ani chuan ka thupêkte a zâwm a, tih tak zetin mi zui a, ka mit hmuhah thil dik chauh a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang zawng, i hmaa mite zawng zawng aiin i sual a; ka huatzâwng tak, pathian dangte leh milem chhûnte i siam a, mi hawisan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng avâng hian i thlahte, mipa fa tawh phawt chu naupang aṭanga puitling thlengin ka tiboral vek dâwn. Bawlhhlawh phiah fai ang maiin i chhûngkua chu ka la bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Jeroboama chhûngte, khawpuia thite chu, ui-in an ei ang a, tâmlaka thi chu chunglêng savaten an tlân ang,’ chu chu Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Nang pawh haw la, khuaa i luh veleh naupang chu a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawngin an sûn ang a, an phûm ang. Jeroboama chhûngte zîngah ani hi zawng Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian mit hmuha ṭha a nih avângin amah chauh hi Jeroboama chhûngte zîngah thlâna phûm a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jeroboama chhûngkaw tiboral tûrin Lalpa chuan Israel-te chunga rorêltu a mi duhzâwng tak a ruat thuai dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu a hrem ang a, lui kam phairuang angin a tinghîng dual dual ang. Israel mite chuan pathiannu Aseri lemte an siam a, Lalpa an tihthinur avângin an pute hnêna a pêk ram ṭha tak aṭangin a sawn chhuak ang a, Eufretis lui râlah a sawn darh vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel-te chu Jeroboaman a hruaisual avângin Lalpa chuan a hawisan ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jeroboama nupui chu Tirza khuaah a hâwng leh ta a, in a thlen veleh an fa chu a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh Ahijan a lo sawi tawh ang khân Israel mite chuan naupang chu an ṭah a, an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jeroboama chanchin dang, a râl beih thu te, a rorêl dân te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jeroboama chu kum sawmhnih leh pahnih chhûng a lal a, a thi a, an phûm a, a fapa Nadaba chuan a ai a awh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Solomona fapa Rehoboama chu kum sawmli leh pakhat a nihin Judai ramah a lal ṭan a. Israel pum puia amah biakna hmun tûr Lalpa thlan Jerusalem-ah kum sâwm leh pariat ro a rêl a. A nu chu Naami, Amon hnam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda mite chu Lalpa mit hmuhah an sual hle a, an pute ai mahin Lalpa an tithinur zual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Milem pathian biakna hmun tam tak an siam a, tlângah te, thingbuk hnuaiah te lung serh leh pathiannu Aseri lim te an phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chu aia la sual zâwk chu an milem biaknaah chuan mipa leh hmeichhiate bawlhhlawh takin an khawsa ho va. Israel fate Kanan ram an lo luha, an hmaa an hnawh chhuah tâk hnamte awm dân mawi lo zawng chu Juda mite hian an la ve ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama lal kum nganaah Aigupta lal Sisaka chuan Jerusalem a rûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa Tempula ro te, lal ina ro te, Solomonan rangkachaka phaw a siamte nên a phur hâwng chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal Rehoboama chuan chûng phaw an lâksak tâk aiah dârin phaw dang a siam leh a, lal in kawngka vêngtute a kawltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lal chu Lalpa Tempula a kal apiangin vêngtute chuan phaw chu an keng a, chumi hnuah pindanah an dah leh hlawm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rehoboama chanchin dangte leh a thiltih zawng zawng chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A lal chhûng zawngin Rehoboama leh Jeroboama chu an indo reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rehoboama chu a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a. A nu chu Naami, Amon hnam a ni. A fapa Abija chuan a ai a awh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama, Israel lal chu kum sâwm leh pariat a lal kumin Judai ramah Abija a lo lal ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah kum thum a lal a, a nu chu Maaki, Absaloma fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa angin thil sual a ti a, a pu Davida hlan ang khân a thinlung chu Lalpa hnênah a hlân ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Davida avângin Lalpa , a Pathian chuan Abija chu a thih hnua Jerusalem-a lal tûr fapa a pe a, Jerusalem khua pawh a humhimsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit mi, Uria chunga thil sual a tih bâk chu Davida chuan Lalpa thupêkte a bawhchhe ngai lo va, a mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abija rorêl chhûng zawng Jeroboama leh Abija chu an indo reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abija chanchin dang, a thiltihte chu Juda lalte chanchin ziaknaah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abija chu a thi a, Davida khawpuiah an phûm a, a fapa Asa chu a pa aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel lal Jeroboama kum sawmhnih a lal kumah, Asa chu Judai ramah a lo lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmli leh pakhat Jerusalem-ah a lal a, a pi chu Absaloma fanu Maaki a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ani chuan a pu Davida angin Lalpa lâwmzâwng a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Milem pathian biakna hmuna mipa leh hmeichhe inzuarte chu ram chhûng ata a hnawt chhuak a, a puten milem pathian an siam zawng zawng chu a tichhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pi Maakin Aseri lim tenawm tak chu a phun avângin, lalnu a nihna a hlihsak a, Asa chuan milem pathiante chu a kit a, Kidron ruamah a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram chhûnga pathian dang an biakna hmun zawng zawng chu lal Asa chuan tibo vek lo mah se, a dam chhûng zawng Lalpa chauh a vuan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pain Pathian hnêna a thilpêk zawng zawng chu Asa chuan tempulah a dah a; amah ngeiin rangkachak leh tangkarua a hlante chu a dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Juda lal Asa leh Israel lal Baasa chu an lal chhûng zawng an indo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel lal Baasa chuan Judai ram a han rûn a, Judai ram aṭanga mi an lo chhuaha, mi dang Judai rama an luh theih loh nân Rama khuaah kulh a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asa chuan Tempul sum bâwm ata leh lal ina rangkachak leh tangkaruate chu a la chhuak a, Damaska khuaa awm Suria lal Ben-hadada hnênah a thawn a. Ben-hadada chu, Heziona tupa, Tabrimona fa a ni. A mi tirhte chuan hetiangin an sawi a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ka pa leh i pa an ṭang dûn ang khân keini pawh i ṭang dûn teh ang. En teh, rangkachak leh tangkarua ka rawn thawn a che: Israel lal Baasa nên in inṭhianna titâwp la, kan ram chhûnga a sipaite hnûk kîr teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ben-hadada chuan Asa thu rawt chu a lo remti a, a sipai hotu a ko va, a sipaite chuan Israel ram chu an rûn ta a. Izon te, Dan te, Abel-beth-maaka te an la a, Galili dîl kiang ramte leh Naftali bial pum pui chu an lâksak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Lal Baasan a hriatin Rama khaw kulh a siam chu a chawlhsan a, Tirza khuaah a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Baasan Rama khaw kulh a siam nân lung leh thing a hmante chu la tûrin Asa chuan Juda ram mi zawng zawng chu a pun a. Benjamin biala Geba leh Mizpa khaw kulh siam nân a hmang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lal Asa thil tih dang, a huaisenzia te, khaw kulh a siam thu te Juda lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang. A tar hnuin a ke-ah hri ṭha lo a vei a, a bawksawp ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asa chu a thi a, Davida khawpuia lal chhûngkaw thlânah an phûm a, a fapa Jehosafata chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum hnihnaah, lal Jeroboama fapa Nadaba chu Israel ramah a lal a, kum hnih ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pa ang bawkin Lalpa mite hmuha thil sual a ti a, Israel-te chu a hruai sual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahija fapa Baasa, Isakar hnama mi chuan Nadaba chu a phiar ru a, Nadaba leh a sipaite chuan Filistia rama Gibethon khua an hual laiin Baasa chuan Nadaba chu a that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum thumnaah Baasa chuan Nadaba chu a that a, a aiawhin Israel ramah chuan a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A lal ṭan chauh tihin Jeroboama chhûngte chu a that vek a. Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawh Ahija, Silo khuaa mi hnêna a sawi tawh ang khân Jeroboama chhûngte chu tu mah zuah lovin a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jeroboama thil sual tih chuan Israel te chu a hruai sual a, chu chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian a tithinur a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nadaba chanchin dang, a thiltih zawng zawng chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Juda lal Asa leh Israel lal Baasa chu an lal chhûng zawng an indo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum thumnaah Ahija fapa Baasa chu Israel mi zawng zawng chungah a lal a, Tirza khuaah kum sawmhnih leh pali ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhah thil sual a ti a, Jeroboama angin Israel-te hruai sualtu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Baasa chungchâng, Zâwlnei Jehua, Hanania fapa hnênah Lalpa thu hetiangin a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Eng mah ni lo kha, Israel-te rorêltu atân ka ruat che a. Tûnah Jeroboama anga thil sual tiin ka mi Israel-te i hruai sual a, an sualna chuan min tithinur ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngte chunga ka tih angin nang leh i chhûngte hi ka tiboral vek dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chhûngte zînga mi khawpuia thi chu ui-in an sa an tlân ang a, ramhnuaia thite chu chunglêng savaten an tlân ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Baasa chanchin dang, a thiltih te, a huaisenzia te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baasa chu a thi a, Tirza khuaah an phûm a, a fapa Ela chu a aiawhin a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Baasa leh a chhûngte chuan Lalpa mit hmuha thil sual an tih nasat êm avângin Hanania fapa zâwlnei Jehua hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a. Lal Jeroboama anga thil sual a tih avâng leh Jeroboama chhûngte a thah vek avângin Lalpa chu a chungah a thinur ta hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda lal Asa kum sawmhnih leh paruk a lal kumah Baasa fapa Ela chu Israel ramah a lal a. Tirza khuaah kum hnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hote zînga pakhat, Zimria, a tawlailîr zâtve lai chunga hotu chu a lakah a hel a. Chutih lai chuan Ela chu Tirza khuaah a awm a. Lal in enkawltu Arza inah zu a lo rui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zimria chu inah chuan a va lût a, Ela chu a that a, a aiah a lal ta a. Chu chu Juda lal Asa kum sawmhnih leh pasarih a lal kum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zimrian lalṭhutthlêng a luah veleh Baasa chhûngte chu a that vek a, a laichîn leh a ṭhian, mipa tawh phawt chu tu mah a zuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Baasa chungchânga zâwlnei Jehua hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng ang chuan Zimria chuan Baasa chhûngte chu a that vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Milem pathian an bia a, Israel-te an hruai sual avângin Baasa leh a fapa Ela chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu an tithinur atin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ela thiltih zawng zawng chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Juda lal Asa, kum sawmhnih leh pasarih a lal kum chuan Zimria chu Tirza khuaah ni sarih chhûng Israel-te chungah a lal a. Israel sipaite chuan Filistia khua Gibethon chu an hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zimrian lal a phiara, lal chu a that tih an hriat chuan chu khaw hualtute chuan, an riahhmunah chuan an hotupa Omria chu Israel lalah an siam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Omria leh a hnêna mi awm zawng chuan Gibethon an ṭînsan a, Tirza khua chu an han hual ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khua an la tih a hriat chuan Zimria chu lal in chhûnga kulhah a tlân lût a, lal inah chuan a inkalhkhum a, a kâng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa mit hmuhin thil a tisual a, Jeroboama kawng a zawh a, Israel-te a hruai sual avângin chu thil chu a chungah a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zimria chanchin dang te, a phiar rûk thu te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna bu-ah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel mipui chu pâwl hnihah an inṭhen a, a zâtve chuan Ginata fapa Tibnia chu lala siam an duh a, a zâtve chuan Omria an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Omria zuitute chuan Ginata fapa Tibnia zuitute chu an hneh ta a. Tibnia chu a thi a, Omria chu a lo lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Juda lal Asa lal kum sawmthum leh pakhat kumin Omria chu Israel-te chungah a lo lal ṭan a. Kum sâwm leh pahnih a lal a, a hun hmasa lam kum ruk chhûng chu Tirza khuaah a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Semera hnên aṭangin Samaria tlâng tangkarua sângrukin a lei a, chutah chuan khawpui a din a, kulh a siam a. Tlâng neitu hmasa Semera hming chawiin a khaw hmingah Samaria a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Omria chuan Lalpa mit hmuhah thil sual a ti ṭhîn a, a hmaa mite zawng zawng aiin a sual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama awm dân ṭha lo zawng zawng a la a, Israel-te chu a hruai sual a, an milem biakte avâng chuan Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu an tithinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Omria chanchin dang, a thil tih theihzia te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Omria chu a lo thi ve ta a, Samaria khuaah an phûm a, a fapa Ahaba chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Juda lal Asa chu kum sawmthum leh pariat a lal kumin Omria fapa Ahaba chu Israel-te chungah a lal ṭan a, Omria fapa Ahaba chu Samaria khuaah kum sawmhnih leh pahnih a lal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Omria fapa Ahaba chuan a hmaa lal zawng zawng ai khân thil sual a ti nasa zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nebata fapa Jeroboama anga sual chu tâwk a ti lo va, Sidon lal Ethbaala fanu Jezebeli chu nupuiah a nei a. Baal pathiante a be ve ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Samaria khuaah Baal pathian maichâm a din a, Baal biakna inte a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Aseri lim a phun bawk a, a hmaa Israel lal zawng zawng aiin Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu a tithinur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahaba lal laiin Bethel mi Hiela chuan Jeriko khua a din ṭha a; Nuna fapa Josua hnêna Lalpa sawi tawh ang khân Hiela chuan lungphûm a phûm avângin a fapa upa ber Abirama a chân a, kulh kawngkhâr a siam ṭhat avângin a fapa naupang ber Seguba a chân bawk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gilead ram Tisbe mi Elija chuan Ahaba hnênah, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian rawng ka bâwl ṭhina hmingin ka hrilh a che, kum hnih kum thum chhûng chu ka thu lo chuan leiah ruah leh dai a tla lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Elija hnênah a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Heta ta hi chhuak la, khawchhak lam pan la, Jordan chhaka Kerith lui kamah han biru rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Luite tui chu i tlân ang a, nangmah châwmtu tûrin choakte thu ka pe tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa sawi ang chuan a ti a, Jordan chhaka Kerith lui chu a pan a, tah chuan a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zîng leh tlaiah choakte chuan chhang leh sa an rawn lâksak ziah ṭhîn a, luite tui chu a tlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu ramah chuan ruah rêng a sûr tâk loh avângin luite tui chu a kang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Elija hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tho la, Sidon biala Zarefat khuaah kal la, tah chuan awm rawh, châwm tûr chein hmeithai pakhat ka ruat tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zarefat khuaah chuan a kal ta a. Chu khaw kulh kawngka a va thlen chuan hmeithai pakhat hian thing a lo fawm a, Hmeithai chu a han au va, “Tui tlêm min han suahsak la, ka lo in ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />La tûra a kal lai chu, “Khawngaih takin chhang tlêm min han pe bawk ang che,” a ti zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmeithai chuan, “ Lalpa , i Pathian nung hmingin ka hrilh a che, chhang zawng ka nei lo, bêlah chhangphut vei khat lek leh bûrah hriak tlêm tê chauh ka nei a. Ka fapa nêna kan ei tûr siam nân thingṭang tlêm tê ka fawm a, chu chu kan ei zawhah rilṭâmin kan thi tawh mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elija chuan, “Mangang suh, hâwng la, in ei tûr chu va siam rawh. Amaherawhchu, chhang tlêm min han siamsak phawt la, mi han pe ang che, a bâk chu i tân leh i fapa tân i siam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ruah ka sûrtîr hma chu chhangphut bêl chu a ruak lo vang a, hriak bûr chu a kang hek lo vang’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmeithai chu a kal a, Elija sawi ang chuan a va ti a; tichuan, an vaia ni rei tak ei tûr chhang a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpan Elija hnêna a sawi ang chuan chhangphut bêl chu a ruak lo va, hriak ûm pawh a kang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan hmeithai fapa chu a dam lo va, a na chu a zual tawlh tawlh a, a thi ta hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmeithai chuan Elija hnênah, “Pathian mi, engati nge hetianga mi tih le? Pathian hmaa ka sualna târ lang tûr leh ka fapa tihlum tûra lo kal i nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elija chuan, “I fapa chu mi han pe teh,” a ti a. A nu pawm lai chu a lâksak a, a chênna pindan chungnungah a pawm chho va, ama khumah a muttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ring takin a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, engtizia nge he thil ṭha lo tak hi he hmeithai chungah hian i thlentîr le? He nu hi a ngilneiin min ti ṭha hle si a, engati nge a fapa hi i tihhlum mai le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, naupang chungah chuan vawi thum a bawk a, a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, he naupang hi tidam leh teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Elija ṭawngṭai chu a chhâng a, naupang chu a lo thaw chhuak a, a dam leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Elija chuan naupang chu a nu hnênah a chhukpui a, a hnênah, “Hei i fapa chu a dam leh ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hmeithai chuan, “Pathian mi i ni a, Lalpa chuan i hnênah thu a sawi tih tûnah ka hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum thum lai khua a khen hnu chuan Lalpa thu chu Elija hnênah a lo thleng a, “Ahaba hnênah va kal rawh, ruah ka sûrtîr dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elija chu Ahaba hmu tûrin a kal ta a, Samaria ramah chuan ṭâm chu a na hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahaba chuan lal in enkawltu Obadia a ko va, ani chu Lalpa ṭih mi tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezebelin Lalpa zâwlnei a thah chiam lai khân Obadia hian zâwlnei za a hruai a, pâwl hniha siamin sawmnga ve vein pûkah a thukru a, chaw leh tui a pe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Obadia hnênah, “Hawh teh, luikawr zawng zawng fang ila, tui i va zawng teh ang. Sakawr leh sabengtungte hi kan chhanhim theih nân hlobet awmnate i va zawng teh ang; chutilo zawng, rante hi kan chân vek dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Fan tûr ram an insem a, Ahaba leh Obadia chu mual hran ve veah an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Obadia chu a kal zêl a, kawngah chuan Elija a tâwk thut a, Obadia chuan ani chu a hria a, kûnin chibai a bûk a, a hnênah, “Ka pu Elija, nang i ni maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ni e, keimah ka ni; kal la, i pu hnênah, Elija hetah a awm tih va hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Obadia chuan, “Eng nge ka tihsuala i chhiahhlawh hi thi tûra Ahaba kuta mi hlan i tum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa , i Pathian nung chhâlin ka sawi e, ka puin ram tin mi tin zîngah a zawng mêk che asin. ‘Hetah a awm lo’ titu chu lalin an hmu lo ngei che a ni tih fiah nân chhia a chhamtîr ziah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan ka pu hnênah kala, ‘Elija chu hetah a awm,’ tih hrilh tûrin mi ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka kalsan hnu chein Lalpa Thlarauvin ka hriat lohna lamah a hruai daih ang che a, Ahaba ka va hrilha, a hmuh si loh che chuan min that mai dâwn asin. Kei i chhiahhlawh hi ka tleirâwl chhuah ata Lalpa betu ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pu hian Jezebelin Lalpa zâwlneite a thah chiam laia ka thiltih kha i hria a ni lâwm ni? Lalpa zâwlnei za, pâwl hniha siamin sawmnga ve ve pûkah ka thukru a, chaw leh tui ka pêk ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûnah ka pu hnêna kal a, ‘Elija hetah a awm,’ tih thu va hrilh tûra min ti mai hi min lo that ngei dâwn asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Elija chuan, “A rawng ka bâwl, Lalpa , Engkim Lalpa, mi nung hmingin vawiinah Ahaba hnênah ka inlan ngei ngei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Obadia chu Ahaba hmu tûr chuan a kal ta a, a va hrilh a; Ahaba chu zâwlnei Elija hmu tûrin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahaban Elija a hmuh chuan a hnênah, “Israel ram chawkbuaitu chu hetah hian a ni maw i lo awm?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Elija chuan, “Israel-te ka tibuai hlei nêm; nangmah leh i pa hi a tibuaitute chu in ni zâwk e. Lalpa thupêk in pawisa lo va, Baal te in be vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tûnah, Israel mi zawng zawng min hmu tûrin Karmel tlângah ko khâwm rawh; Baal zâwlnei zali leh sawmnga leh Aseri zâwlnei zali, Jezebeli châwmte chu rawn hruai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Israel ram pumah thu a than a, Baal zâwlneite chu Karmel tlângah a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elija chu mipui zîngah a lo ding chhuak a, an hnênah, “Tuilairapin eng chen nge in awm dâwn? Lalpa chu Pathian a nih chuan bia ula. Baal chu Pathian a nih leh bia ang che u,” a ti a, Mipui chu an ngawi reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Elija chuan mipui hnênah, “ Lalpa zâwlnei la dam chhun ka ni a, Baal zâwlneite erawh chu zali leh sawmnga lai an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bâwngpa pahnih han la ula, pakhat chu Baal zâwlneite pual atân talh sela; chan sawm sela, thing chungah dah sela hâl rih suh se. Bâwngpa dang chu keiin ka buatsaih ve ang a, thing chungah ka dah ang a, ka hâl bîk lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangni Baal zâwlneiten in pathian in ko vang a, keiin Lalpa ka ko vang a, meia rawn hâltu zâwk chu Pathian dik a ni ang,” a ti a. Mipui chuan, “Ni ang hmiang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elija chuan Baal zâwlneite hnênah, “Nangni in tam zâwk a, bâwngpa pakhat hi buatsaih hmasa rawh u, in pathian chu ko ula hâl erawh chu hâl suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An puala bâwngpa ruat chu an la a, an buatsaih a, “Aw Baal, min han chhâng teh,” tiin zîng aṭangin chhûn thlengin an au an au va, an maichâm siam chu an lâm hual an lâm hual a; mahse, a rawn chhâng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chhûnah chuan Elija chuan nuihzatbûr chungin, “Au ta vak vak che u, pathian a ni lâwm ni? A inngaihtuah mêk emaw, a inthiar emaw, a zin emaw a ni mai thei! A muhîl a ni ang, kaitho rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An au ring tawlh tawlh a, an tih ṭhin dân angin chemte leh feiin thisen chhuak zawih zawih khawpin an invit a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni a lo thlang her a, tlai lam inthawi hun thlengin an au dual dual a, tu mah chhângtu an awm lo va, thâwm eng mah hriat a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Elija chuan mipui hnênah, “Lo kal hnai teh u khai,” a ti a. Mite chuan an va hnaih a, Lalpa maichâm chim rem rum chu a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpan , “I hming chu Israela an ti ang,” tia a lo sawi Jakoba fa sâwm leh pahnih pualin lung sâwm leh pahnih Elija chuan a la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûng lung chuan Lalpa tân maichâm a siam a. Maichâm vêl chuan lei a lai khuar a, chu chu tui litar sâwm leh pali dawng lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Maichâm chungah chuan thing a chhep a, bâwngpa chu a chan sawm a, thing chungah chuan a dah a. Mite hnênah, “Bêl pali-ah tui chhûng khat ula, hâlral thilhlan leh thing hi leih huh vek rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />An leih huh ta vek a, vawi thum an leih nawn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />maichâm vêla lei laih khuar khat vek khawpin maichâm chu an leih huh hnêp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tlai lam inthawi hunah zâwlnei Elija chuan maichâm chu a rawn pan hnai a, a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te Pathian, Israel Pathian i nih te, i thupêka hêng thil hi ti ka nih te tûnah han târ lang teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ṭawngṭai ngaithla la, min han chhâng teh! Tichuan, hêng mite hian Lalpa Pathian chu i ni tih an hria ang a, simin i lamah an lo kîr leh dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mei a rawn tîr a, hâlral thilhlan te, thing te, lung te chu a kâng ral vek a, lei pawh a kâng sen huam a, khuara tui tling chu a hîp kang vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mipuiin chu chu an hmuhin leiah an bawkkhup a, “ Lalpa hi Pathian chu a ni, Lalpa hi Pathian chu a lo ni ngei e,” tiin an au chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Elija chuan mipui hnênah, “Baal zâwlneite hi tu mah chhuah lovin man vek rawh u,” a ti a. Mite chuan an man a, Elija chuan Kison ruamah a hruai thla a, chutah chuan a that ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Elija chuan Ahaba hnênah, “Khai le, eiin in tawh rawh, ruah a lo sûr dâwn tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahaba chu ei leh in tûrin a kal ta a. Elija erawh chu Karmel tlâng chhîp lamah a chho va, a khûp kârah a kûn reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh hnênah chuan, “Kal chhuak la, tuifinriat lam han thlîr teh,” a ti a. Ani chu a tho va, a han hawi vêl a, “Eng mah ka hmu lo,” a ti a. Elija chuan chutianga hawi vêl tûrin vawi sarih lai a kaltîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A vawi sarihnaah chuan a chhiahhlawh chuan, “Tuifinriat aṭangin kuttum tiat lek chhûm a lo chho nel nel e,” a ti a. Elija chuan a chhiahhlawh hnênah, “Kal la, Ahaba chu a tawlailîr buatsaiha chhuak vat tûrin hrilh rawh, ruahin a dang dah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Rei lo teah chhûm dum vânah a lo lang tup tup a, thlite a lo tleh ta hum hum a, ruahpuivânâwn a lo sûr ta a; Ahaba chu a tawlailîrah a zuang lût a, Jezreel lamah a tlân haw ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lalpa thiltihtheihna chu Elija chungah a lo thleng a, a kawrfual chu a kâwngah a vêt chhîng sauh sauh va, Jezreel panin Ahaba chu a tlân pêl ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Jezebeli hnênah Elija thiltih zawng zawng, zâwlneiho khandaiha a thah thute chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jezebeli chuan Elija hnênah, “Zâwlneiho chunga i tih angin naktûk tûn ang huna ka thah loh vaih che chuan pathianten an tih tihin min ti sela, nasa tak pawhin min sawisa rawh se, a ti,” tia hrilh tûrin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elija chuan a hlau va, himna zawngin a tlânchhe ta a. Judai rama Beer-seba a lo thleng a, chutah chuan a chhiahhlawh chu a hnutchhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chu thlalêrah nilêngin a kal leh a, thingbuk hnuaiah a ṭhu a, thih a dîl ta a, “Ka tlin ta lo, aw Lalpa , ka nun hi la mai teh, ka tân thih a ṭha zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thingbuk hnuaiah chuan a mu a, a lo muhîl ta a. Vântirhkoh hian a rawn khawih harh a, a hnênah, “Tho la, ei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A han hawi a, a lu bulah chuan chhang ur hmin sa leh tuithâwl a lo awm a. Chhang chu a ei a, tui a in bawk a, a mu leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa tirhkoh chu a lo kal leh a, a rawn khawih harh a, “Tho la, ei rawh, i kalna tûr a la hla hle si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tho va, a eiin a in a, a thil ei chuan a tichak thar leh ta a. Pathian tlâng Horeb a thlen thlengin ni sawmli leh zan sawmli a kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuta pûk pakhatah chuan riak tûrin a lût a. Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Elija, hetah hian eng nge i tih?” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Engkim Lalpa tân ṭhahnem ka ngai êm êm ṭhîn a; mahse, Israel-te chuan i thuthlung an bawhchhia a, i maichâm an tichim a, i zâwlneite khandaihin an that a; kei chauh hi ka la dam a, kei pawh hi min thah an tum a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Lo chhuak la, tlângchhîpah lo kal la, Lalpa hmaah lo ding rawh,” a ti a. Lalpa chu a lo kal a, thlipui na tak a rawn tlehtîr a, tlâng chu a chhêm chim a, lungpuite a chhêm keh rem rum a; mahse, thliah chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo. Thli chu a reh a, lîr a nghîng leh dur dur a, lîrnghîngah chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lîr nghîn zawh chuan mei a lo chhuak a; mahse meiah pawh chuan Lalpa chu a awm lo. Mei a lo chhuah zawhah chuan ri lo aw a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Elijan a han hriat chuan a kawrfualin a hmai a hup a, pûk kawngkaah a lo ding chhuak a, aw chuan, “Elija, hetah hian eng nge i tih?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Engkim Lalpa tân ṭhahnem ka ngai êm êm a; mahse, Israel-te chuan i thuthlung an bawhchhia a, i maichâmte an tichim a, i zâwlneite khandaihin an that a, kei chauh hi ka la dam a, kei pawh hi min thah an tum a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Thlalêr kawngah kîr leh la, Damaska khuaah lût la, Hazaela chu Suria lal atân hriak thih la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimsia fapa Jehua pawh Israel lal atân hriak thih bawk ang che. Tin, Abel Mehola khuaah Safata fapa Elisa chu i aiawha zâwlnei ni tûrin hriak thih bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hazaela khandaih pumpelh apiang Jehuan a that ang a, Jehua khandaih pumpelh chu Elisan a lo that ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel ramah hian Baal hmaa la ṭhingṭhi ngai lo leh la fâwp ngai lo mi sângsarih ka tân ka zuah dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Elija chu a chhuak a, Safata fapa Elisa ho chuan bâwngpa tuak sâwm leh pahnih lei letah an lo chhawr a, a tuak sâwm leh pahnihna chu Elisa chuan a khalh a. Elija chuan a va pan a, a puan sin lai chu a bahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elisa chuan a bâwngte chu a tlânsan a, Elija chu a ûm ta a. Elija hnênah chuan, “Ka nu leh pa ka va chibai zet ang e; tichuan, ka rawn zui ang che,” a ti a. Elija chuan, “Va kal rawh, i chunga ka thiltih kha i hria alâwm maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elisa chu a kîr leh ta a, a bâwng chhawr laite chu a va talh a, leilehna hmanruate chu a sa chhum nân a hmang a, sa chu mite a pe a, an ei a. Tichuan, Elija zui tûrin a chhuak a, a rawng a bâwlsak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Suria lal Ben-hadada chuan a sipai rual a khâwm a, lal sawmthum leh pahnihin an sakawr leh tawlailîrte nên an ṭanpui a. Samaria khua an pan a, an bei ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan khawpui chhûngah mi a tîr a, Israel lal Ahaba hnênah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“I hausakna zawng zawng leh in nupui fanaute nên khân inpe rawh u,” tiin a vau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel lal chuan “Aw lalber ka pu, i sawi ang chuan kei leh ka neih zawng zawng hi i ta a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ben-hadada chuan Ahaba hnênah mi a tîr leh a, “In tangkarua leh rangkachak te, in nupui fanau te nên inpe rawh u ka ti tak na a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />naktûk tûn ang hunah ka mite ka rawn tîr zâwk ang e; lal in leh milianhovin an rawn dap ang a, in ro hlu zawng zawng an rawn lâksak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel lal chuan ram hruaitu zawng zawng a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “He mi hian mi tihboral a tum tih in hria e, ka nupui leh fanau te, ka tangkarua leh rangkachak te a rawn ngên a, ka lo remti a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hruaituho leh mipui chuan, “A thu pawisa suh la, a dîl pawh eng mah pe suh,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Ben-hadada hnênah mi a tîr a, “Lalber ka pu chu hetiangin va hrilh rawh u, ‘I chhiahhlawh hian i dîl hmasak zâwk chu ka remti a, a hnuhnûng erawh chu ka remti thei lo,’ a ti,” tiin mi tirhte chuan a sawi ang chuan an va sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ben-hadada chuan hetiangin a rawn sawi lêttîr leh a. “Samaria khua tichhe vek tûrin ka mite tam tak ka rawn tîr ang, eng mah an zuah lo vang. Chutianga ka tih loh vaih chuan pathianten an duh tâwkin min sawisa mai rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel lal chuan, “Sipai huaisen zawng indo hma ni lovin indo zawhah a nia an uan ṭhin tih va hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ben-hadada leh a ṭanrualpui lalte chuan an puan ina zu an in lai chuan chu thu chu an lo hria a, a sipaite chu khawpui bei tûrin thu a pe a, an insiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan zâwlnei pakhat hi lal Ahaba hnênah a lo kal a, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hêng sipai rual tam tak hi hlau reng reng suh, vawiinah i kutah ka pe dâwn a ni; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih i hria ang,’ a ti,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahaba chuan, “Tu-in nge ho vang?” a ti a. Zâwlnei chuan, Lalpan heti hian a ti: ‘Ram bung hrang awptu hnuaia sipaiho thlan chhuahten an ho vang,’ a ti,” a ti a. Ahaba chuan, “Tu nge hruai ang?” a ti a. Zâwlnei chuan “Nangin le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahaba chuan ram bung hrang hrang awptute hnuaia sipai thothâng ṭha tak takte chu a ko khâwm a, an vaiin zahnih sawmthum pahnih an ni. Israel sipai zawng zawng a ko khâwm leh a, an vaiin sângsarih an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûnah an bei ṭan a, Ben-hadada leh a ṭanrualpui lal sawmthum leh pahnih chu an puan inah an lo rui hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ram bung hrang awptute hnuaia sipai thlante chuan an rawn pan a, Ben-hadada dah râlvêngtu chuan, “Samaria khua aṭangin sipai an lo thawk chhuak e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Rem thu sawi tûr an ni emaw, min rawn bei tûr an ni emaw a nung chungin lo man rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram bung hrang awptute hnuaia sipai thlante chuan an rawn bei a, anmahni zuitu sipai dangte chuan an rawn pui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tinin an bitum chu an that ta ṭheuh va, Suria-ho chu an tlânchhe ta a. Israel-hote chuan an ûm a, Suria lal Ben-hadada chu a sakawr chungchuang mi ṭhenkhat nên an tlân chhuak hrâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel lal chuan a va pan a, sakawr leh tawlailîrte chu a bei a, Suria mite chu a that ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lal Ahaba hnênah zâwlnei chu a lo kal leh a, a hnênah, “Hâwng la, sipai lâk belh sauh sauh rawh, fîmkhur takin thil ruahman ang che, nakkum ṭhâlah Suria lal hian a rawn bei leh dâwn che a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Suria lal hnênah a ṭhuihruaite chuan, “Israel Pathiante chu tlângram Pathian an ni a; chuvângin, alâwm kan hneh loh, phaizâwlah bei ila kan hneh ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lal sawmthum leh pahnihte chu an thuneihna chhuhsak vek la, an aiawhtu tûr hruaitu dang ruat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sipai i hloh zât chiah la thar leh la; chutiang bawkin sakawr leh sakawr-tawlailîrte pawh buatsaih leh ang che. Tichuan, Israel-te chu phaizâwlah kan bei ang a, kan hneh tawh ang,” an ti a. Benhadada chuan an thurâwn ang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kum leh ṭhalah chuan Ben-hadada chuan a sipaite chu a khâwm a, Israel-te bei tûrin Afek khuaah a chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel-te pawh chu an pung khâwm a, ei tûrte an chhêk a. An lo thawk chhuak a, Suria-ho epah chuan hmun hnihah ṭanhmun an khuar a. Suria-ho lakah chuan Israel-te chu kêlno tlêm tê bawk khâwm ang lek an ni a. Suria-ho erawh chu a ram khahin an khat mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zâwlnei pakhat hi Israel lal Ahaba hnênah a lo kal a, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Suria-hovin Lalpa chu tlângram Pathian a ni a, phaizâwl Pathian zawng a ni lo an tih avângin hêng sipai tam tak hi i kutah ka pe ang a, nang leh i mite hian Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng Suria-ho leh Israel-te chu an ṭanhmunah chuan an inep a, a ni sarih ni chuan an inbei ṭan ta a. Israel sipaite chuan Suria sipai nuai khat lai ni khat chhûngin an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A la dam zawng chu Afek khaw chhûngahte an tlân lût a, kulh bang chimin mi sînghnih leh sângsarih a delh hlum leh a; Ben-hadada chu khawpuiah a tlân lût a, pindan chhûngrilah a biru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hote chuan a hnênah, “Ngai teh, Israel lalte chu an ngilnei hle ṭhîn tih kan hria a, saiip puan vengin kan lu-ah hruizên kan vêt ang a, Israel lal hnênah min va kaltîr la, anin a zuah mial mahna che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tichuan, saiip puan an fêng a, an nghâwngah hruiin an hlîng a, Israel lal hnênah chuan an va kal a, a hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh ‘Ben-hadada chuan, khawngaih takin min zuah hrâm rawh se,’ a ti e” an ti a. Ahaba chuan, “A la dam a ni maw? Ka unaupa a ni alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mite chuan ngaihṭha takin, “Aw, i unaupa a ni e,” an lo ti ve var a. Lal chuan, “Va kal ula, rawn hruai rawh u,” a ti a. Ben-hadada chu a lo chhuak a, Ahaba chuan a bulah tawlailîra chuang ve tûrin a sâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ben-hadada chuan, “Ka pain i pa khua a lo lâksakte chu ka pe kîr leh ang che a, ka pain sumdâwnna hmun Samaria khuaa a siam ang khân Damaska khuaah i siam ve dâwn nia,” a ti a. Ahaba chuan, “Chutianga thu i tiam avâng chuan ka chhuah leh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zâwlneiho zînga pakhat hian Lalpa thupêkin a zâwlneipui pakhat hnênah, “Mi han vaw teh khai,” a ti a. Ani chuan a vaw duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zâwlnei chuan, “ Lalpa thu i awih loh avângin mi kalsan veleh sakeibakneiin a lo seh ang che,” a ti a. Chu mi chu a kal chhuak a, sakeibaknei chuan a lo seh hlum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zâwlnei chuan mi dang a va hmu a, a hnênah, “Mi han vaw teh,” a ti leh a. Ani chuan na takin a vua a, a sil ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Zâwlnei chuan a hmêl thup nân a hmai puanin a tuam a, Israel lal lo kal nghâkin kawng sîrah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lal a lo kal chuan zâwlnei chuan a lo au va, a hnênah, “I chhiahhlawh hi indona hmunah ka kal a, mi pakhat hi a sal man nên a lo kal a, ‘He mi hi vêng rawh, a tlân bo chuan a aiah ka that ang che, anih loh leh tangka zathum i chawi ang,’ min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hian thil dang ka tih buai laiin ani chu a tlân bo ta daih mai si a,” a ti a. Israel lal chuan, “I thiam lo a nih chu, a mawh chu nangman i phur tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Chu veleh zâwlnei chuan a mit tuamna a phelh a, Israel lal chuan zâwlneiho zînga pakhat kha a ni tih a hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lal hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Mi thi tûra ka ruat i chhuah avângin a thih ai i thi ang a, a mite tuar ai i miten an tuar ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel lal chu thinur ṭeuh leh lunghnûr takin Samaria khuaah a haw ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jezreel khuaa Samaria lal Ahaba in kiangah chuan Jezreel mi Nabota an tih chuan grep huan a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Nabota hnênah, “Ka in kianga i grep huan hi thlai huan atân min pe rawh. A aiah grep huan ṭha zâwk ka pe ang che, i duh zâwk phei chuan, a man âwm tâwk tangka ka pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nabota chuan Ahaba hnênah, “Kan pute hun lai aṭanga kan huan ro a ni a, chutiang han pêk che chu Lalpa ngaihin a âwm lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jezreel mi Nabotan, “Kan pute huan ro ka pe thei lo vang che,” a tih avângin lunghnûr tak leh thinur ṭeuhvin Ahaba chu a in lamah a hâwng ta a. Bang lam hawiin a khumah a mu a, chaw a ei duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nupui Jezebeli chu a va kal a, a hnênah, “Engtizia nge i ngui bûra, chaw i ei duh loh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Jezreel mi Nabota chu a grep huan leiah ka dîl a, a duh zâwk phei chuan a aiah grep huan dang ka pe ang che ka ti a. Ani chuan, ‘Ka grep huan zawng ka pe lo vang che,’ tiin min chhâng alâwm maw le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nupui Jezebeli chuan a hnênah, “Tho la, hlim takin chaw ei rawh, Jezreel mi Nabota grep huan neihsak dân tûr keiman ka ngaihtuahsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, Ahaba hmingin lehkha a ziak a, a chhinchhiahna a chhu a, Nabota awmna khuaa awm ve upate, rorêltute chu a thawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Heti hian a ziak a, “Chaw nghei ni puang ula, mipui ko khâwmin Nabota chu mipui hmaah ṭhuttîr ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi sual pahnih amah hêktu tûr a hma zâwnah ṭhuttîr ula, ‘Pathian leh lal i sawichhia a ni,’ tiin hêk sela, khua ata hnûkchhuak ula, dêng hlum ang che u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Nabota chênna khaw upate leh rorêltute chuan Jezebelin tih dân tûr a hrilh ang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chaw nghei ni an puang a, mipui an ko khâwm a, Nabota chu a laiah an ṭhuttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi sual pahnih hian, “Pathian leh lal a sawichhia a ni,” tiin an hêk a. Nabota chu khua ata an hnûk chhuak a, an dêng hlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jezebeli hnênah chuan, “Nabota chu a thi ta,” tiin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jezebelin Nabota an dêng hlum ta tih a hriat veleh Ahaba hnênah chuan, “Tho la, Jezreel mi Nabota grep huan, a leitîr phal loh che kha, va neihsak rawh le, ani chu a thi tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Nabota a thi tawh tih a hriat chuan a grep huan neihsak tûr chuan a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Tisbe mi Elija hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tho la, Samaria khuaa awm Israel lal Ahaba hmu tûrin kal tawh. Tûnah Nabota grep huan neihsak tumin chutah chuan a awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hnênah, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Nabota tihhlum tâwk ti lovin a huan leh zêl neihsak i tum elo?’ va ti rawh, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Ui-in Nabota thisen an liahna hmun ngeiah hian i thisen an liak ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Elija hnênah, “Mi hre chhuak ta a ni maw ka hmêlma pa?” a ti a. Elija chuan, “Aw, ka rawn hre ta che a nih hi, Lalpa mit hmuha thil dik lo ti tûrin inhralh ta hek che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I chungah chhiatna ka rawn thlentîr dâwn a ni. In chhûngkuaa mipa fa tawh phawt chu naupang leh tar pawh, nangmah nên ka tiboral vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I chhûngkua chu Nebata fapa Jeroboama chhûngkua ang leh Ahija fapa lal Baasa chhûngkua angin ka sawisa ang; min tithinur tûra Israel-te i hruai sual tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jezebeli chungthu pawh heti hian a ti: ‘Jezreel khawpuiah ui-in a sa an la ei ang. Ahaba chhûngkaw zînga mi khawpuia thi apiang ui-in an ei ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ramhnuaia thi apiang chunglêng savaten an tlân ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nupui Jezebeli fuihpawrha Lalpa mit hmuha thil ṭha lo ti tûra inpe Ahaba ang hi tu mah an awm rêng rêng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-te hmaa Lalpa hnawh chhuah Amor-ho angin Ahaba hian milemte a bia a, thil tenawm tak tak a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Elijan chutiang thu a hrilh zawh chuan Ahaban a puan a pawtthlêr a, saiip puan a sin a, chaw a nghei a, saiip puan chungah a mu a, ngui takin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu Tisbe mi Elija hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ahaba ka hmaa a inngaihtlâwmzia hi i hria maw? Hetianga a inngaihtlâwm avângin a dam chhûng chuan a chungah chhiatna ka thlentîr lo vang a, a fapa hun chhûngin a chhûngte chungah chhiatna ka thlentîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum thum chhûng chu Suria-ho leh Israel-te chu indo lovin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kum thum kum chuan Juda lal Jehosafata chu Israel lal Ahaba hnênah a zu kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel lal chuan a upate hnênah, “Gilead rama Ramot khua hi kan ta a ni reng si a, engtizia nge Suria lal hnên ata kan lâk lêt loh?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jehosafata hnênah chuan, “Ramot khua mi han beihpui peih em?” a ti a. Jehosafata chuan Israel lal hnênah chuan, “Kal i peih hun hunah kei leh ka sipaite chu kan inpeih alâwm, kan pui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Lalpa , i râwn hmasa zet teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahaba chuan zâwlnei zali rual lai chu a ko va, “Ramot khua ka han bei ang em?” tiin a râwn a. Anni chuan, “Bei rawh, Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jehosafata chuan, “Zâwlnei dang, Lalpa min râwnsak tûr an awm lâwm ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel lal chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Imla fapa Mikaia chu a awm. Ani hian thil ṭha eng mah min hrilh lâwksak ngai lo va, ka ngei hle asin. Thil ṭha lo eng emaw a hril lâwk zêl ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a. Jehosafata chuan, “Lal meuhvin chuti êma tih tûr em ni le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan hotu pakhat a ko va, Mikaia hruai tûrin a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lal pahnih chu Samaria khawpui kawngkhâr pâwn hruihah, lalṭhutthlêng an chhawpah chuan an ṭhu a, zâwlnei rual chuan an kal hual a, thu an hril bual bual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An zînga pakhat, Kenaana fapa Zedekia chuan thîr, seki lem a siam a, Ahaba hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Suria-ho chu hêng hian i bei ang a, i tudawl dêr ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zâwlnei dangte pawh chuan chutiang bawk chuan an ti a, “Kal la, Ramot khua chu han bei rawh, i hneh ngei ang, Lalpa chuan a hnehtîr ang che,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikaia hruaitu tûra an tirh chuan a hnênah, “Zâwlnei dang zawng zawngin a ṭha lamin lal hnênah thu an puang a, nang pawhin chutiang chuan ti ve mai ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “ Lalpa , mi nung hming chhâlin ka sawi e, Lalpa chuan sawi tûra min tih chauh ka sawi ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lal Ahaba hnên a va thlen chuan lal chuan, “Mikai, Gilead rama Ramot khua hi kan han bei ang nge bei lo vang?” a ti a. Mikaia chuan, “Han bei teh rêng u, in hneh mawlh ang, Lalpa chuan hnehtîr che u ang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahaba chuan, “ Lalpa hminga ka hnêna thu i sawiin thu dik chauh min hrilh rawh vawi eng zât nge ka tih dâwn che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Vêngtu nei lo berâm angin Israel mite chu tlânga an darh chum chum ka hmu, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Hêng mite hian hruaitu an nei lo, thlamuang takin mahni in lamah hâwng mai rawh se,’ a ti e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Ngai ta che, ka tâna thil ṭha tûr eng mah a sawi ngai lo tih ka hrilh che kha, thil ṭha lo lam hlîr a ni a sawi ṭhin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mikaia chuan a sawi zêl a, “ Lalpa thu hi lo ngaithla teh. Vâna a lalṭhutthlêngah Lalpa ṭhu ka hmu a; Vântirhkohte chuan an din hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Tu nge Ahaba hnênah zu chhuk ang a, Ramot beia thi tûrin zu bum ang?’ Lalpa chuan a ti a. Vântirhkoh ṭhenkhat chuan thu khat an sawi a, a dangin thu dang an sawi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlarau pakhat hi a lo kal a, Lalpa hmaah chuan a va ding a, ‘Ka zu bum ang e,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, ‘Engtin nge i bum ang?’ a ti a. Thlarau chuan, ‘Ka zu kal ang a, Ahaba zâwlneite chu dâwt ka hrilh ang,’ a ti a. Lalpa chuan, ‘Kal la, zu bum rawh, i hlawhtling ngei ang,’ a ti a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Chutiang chu a ni, Lalpa chuan hêng zâwlneite hi i hnênah dâwt a sawitîr a ni, Lalpa ngeiin i chhiatna tûr a ruat tawh a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zâwlnei Zedekia chuan Mikaia chu a pan a, a bêng a, “Engtik lai khân nge Lalpa thlarauvin min kalsana, i hnêna thu a sawi tâk le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mikaia chuan a chhâng a, “Pindan chhûngrila i bihrûk hunah i hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahaba chuan hotu pakhat hnênah, “Mikaia kha man la, khaw awptu Amona hnênah hruai la, Lal fapa Joasa pawh hmuhtîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dam têa ka lo kîr leh hma chu ripah khung sela, chhang leh tui chauh pe rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mikaia chuan, “Nungdama i lo haw chuan Lalpa hian mi be lo a ni ang. Ka sawi hi mi tinin hre rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lal Ahaba leh lal Jehosafata chu Gilead biala Ramot khua bei tûr chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahaba chuan Jehosafata hnênah, “Kan inbeih hunah, ka inchei danglam ang a, nang chu lal incheiin inchei zêl ang che,” a ti a. Lal Ahaba chu a inchei danglam a, inbeihnaah chuan a tel ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Suria lal chuan tawlailîr khalhtu hotu sawmthum leh pahnih chu, “Israel lal chauh lo chu tu mah bei suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chûngho chuan Jehosafata an hmuh chuan Israel lal emaw an ti a, an rawn bei ta a. Jehosafata chu a au chiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tawlailîr khalhtu hotu chuan Israel lal a ni lo tih a hre ta a, a rawn ûm duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Suria sipai thal kâp mai mai hian lal Ahaba chu a râlthuam inkârah a kâp fuh palh a. A tawlailîr khalhtu hnênah chuan, “Hliam ka tuar e, lêt la, inbeihna hmun ata tlân chhuak rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An inbeih mup mup lai chuan Ahaba chu a tawlailîr bang nghêngin Suria mite lam hawiin an tung a. Thisen chu tawlailîr chhuata tling rui khawpin a chhuak a, tlai lamah chuan a thi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni tlâk dâwn ruai chuan Israel sipai zawng zawng hnênah thu a lo thleng a, “Mi tin mahni khaw lamah hâwn vek tûr,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lal Ahaba chu a thi ta a, a ruang chu Samaria khuaah an hâwnpui a, an phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A tawlailîr chu nawhchizuarte insilna ṭhin Samaria dîlah chuan an sil fai a; uite chuan a thisen chu an liak a, Lalpa sawi ang chu a lo thleng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lal Ahaba thiltih dangte, a lal in sainghova a chei dân te, khawpui a din ṭan te chu Israel lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A thih hnu chuan a fapa Ahazia chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel lal Ahaba lal kum linaah Asa fapa Jehosafata chu Judai ramah a lal ṭan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jehosafata chu a lal tirh chuan kum sawmthum leh panga a ni. Jerusalem-ah kum sawmhnih leh panga chhûng ro a rêl a. A nu chu Azubi, Silhia fanu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pa angin Pathian mit hmuha thil ṭha a ti ṭhîn. Milem biakna hmunsâng erawh chu a tichhe lo va; chuvângin, mipuite chu hmunsângahte chuan an la inthawi reng a, rimtuite an hâl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Jehosafata chu Israel lal nên an inrem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehosafata thil tih dang, indonaa a huaisenzia te chu Juda lalte chanchin ziakna buah a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />A pa Asa dam laia mipa leh hmeichhia milem biakna hmuna inzuar ṭhînte chu a tibo vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Edom ram chuan lal an nei lo va, Juda lalin a aiawhtu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ofir rangkachak phur tûrin lal Jehosafata chuan lawng rual a siam a; mahse, Ezion-geber-ah a chhiat tâk avângin an zin ngai ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Israel lal Ahazia chuan a mite chu Jehosafata mite nên zin ho se a ti a; mahse, Jehosafata chuan a duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Jehosafata chu a thi ta a, Davida khawpuia lalho thlânah an phûm a, a fapa Jehorama chu a aiawhin a lal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Juda lal Jehosafata lal kum sâwm leh pasarih kumin Ahaba fapa Ahazia chu Israel-te chunga ro rêl tûrin Samaria khuaah a lo lal a. Kum hnih chhûng ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Lalpa duh loh zâwng thil sual a ti a; a pa Ahaba te, a nu Jezebeli te, lal Jeroboama te ang bawkin thil sual a ti a, Israel-te hruai sualtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />A pu ang bawkin Baal pathian rawng a bâwl avângin Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chu a tithinur hle a.
  </para>
</usx>
